SY_TALK("RYkVaE9wzQE",[[69,["The other day I talked to you about"]],[74,["the importance of dedication in Sahaja Yoga"]],[79,["and the devotion that one should have."]],[85,["Actually, when we are close to the mountain,"]],[90,["we can’t see much of it,"]],[93,["and that’s why we don’t realize"]],[97,["the volume that is so close to us,"]],[102,["the greatness that is facing us."]],[110,["This is one of the illusions that works out"]],[113,["for people who do not realize it mentally —"]],[120,["what they are in for,"]],[123,["where are they, what have they found,"]],[125,["what is Self-realization, what is its magnitude,"]],[128,["how far they have to go,"]],[133,["why are they chosen, what is their purpose of life,"]],[138,["how far they have come up, how far they can understand."]],[146,["All these things are beyond the grasp,"]],[151,["and one gets stunned, one doesn’t know"]],[155,["what has happened to him when he got Realization actually."]],[164,["That’s why to understand this is only possible"]],[169,["if you can understand how to dedicate,"]],[174,["how to devote yourself."]],[178,["If you want to analyze anything"]],[181,["on the basis of your rationality, you are too stunned."]],[186,["It’s too beyond you. It’s fantastic."]],[189,["It is too much. It’s really beyond you."]],[192,["Now think of it — you have got Realization. Can you believe it?"]],[196,["That you can, in your life time…"]],[198,["if somebody had told you this, you would never have believed it —"]],[202,["that how can you get your Realization in this earth?"]],[205,["Of course you were seeking —"]],[207,["because people were saying we have to seek,"]],[209,["also you felt you have to seek —"]],[210,["but you never thought that this will materialize like this,"]],[214,["that you will get your Realization."]],[216,["Then, after getting Realization, you could not feel what it was."]],[222,["Just if you have dropped into the ocean,"]],[224,["and you don’t know what is the dimension of this ocean."]],[227,["How far you have gone into it?"]],[230,["What is it? Where are we? What is our purpose?"]],[235,["To add up to all the mess, we become thoughtless."]],[241,["So you cannot even find out as to, rationally, what it is."]],[249,["So, the immensity of this experience,"]],[256,["the glory of your Mother’s coming,"]],[263,["or the precious gift of your Self-realization —"]],[267,["nothing can be realized through your understanding."]],[271,["Try to think — what have you got?"]],[275,["Can you measure it with your understanding?"]],[278,["Can you understand what has happened?"]],[282,["No, you cannot."]],[284,["Because rationality cannot give you"]],[286,["the dimensions into which you have fallen."]],[291,["The rationality is actually broken out."]],[294,["There is no rationality left now anymore"]],[297,["to even communicate as to what you have been"]],[301,["seeking and where have you landed."]],[304,["So the only method you have got now —"]],[308,["or only way is left to you —"]],[310,["for a drop which has become an ocean,"]],[313,["is to dissolve more in the ocean,"]],[316,["so that you feel the ocean at least."]],[320,["And to communicate with other drops"]],[322,["in such a way that you know the whole through all of them."]],[331,["So first is a complete devotion. It’s very important."]],[337,["In this incarnation only it is so very important —"]],[342,["because you have got Realization."]],[345,["If you did not have Realization — all right."]],[348,["Murmuring souls — all right. Half-baked people — all right."]],[353,["Little bit misbehaving — all right."]],[356,["This can be forgiven, that can be forgiven… everything is forgiven."]],[361,["To look at it, everybody thinks that “Mother is forgiving us.”"]],[366,["But that’s not the point."]],[369,["I am forgiving because of My own nature."]],[374,["But you do not take it for granted."]],[377,["You are harming yourself by accepting that forgiveness."]],[382,["If you all the time think,"]],[383,["“O Mother, You are so forgiving, please forgive me”…"]],[385,["you are already forgiven, as it is."]],[387,["Once you call Me “Mother”, you’re forgiven."]],[389,["But what’s the advantage?"]],[391,["You don’t have any advantage out of it."]],[394,["You are a loser."]],[396,["And this point at least rationally if you understand,"]],[401,["then you will understand what is a devotion."]],[408,["So, in devotion of Sahaja Yoga, one has to realize"]],[416,["that the things that are in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[420,["that you have seen in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[421,["are beyond your mind — first thing."]],[424,["Definitely, they are beyond human conception."]],[427,["So, on human level, you do not discuss them,"]],[429,["and you do not talk about them."]],[432,["But on the collective level you can talk."]],[439,["And when you come to the collective level,"]],[442,["then you have to understand"]],[444,["that relationship with Me is more established, better established"]],[449,["if you establish your relationships with others,"]],[454,["in a very collective and homogeneous way."]],[457,["As I told you, the drop becomes the ocean;"]],[461,["and the drop has to become the ocean"]],[463,["by dissolving all its “dropness”"]],[468,["with other drops."]],[470,["And all the drops dropping their dropness"]],[474,["become the ocean ultimately."]],[477,["So we’ll see that devotion is double-wedged:"]],[481,["one is to each other, and one is to your Mother."]],[487,["In Sahaja Yoga, whatever I see, you cannot see."]],[490,["This is proved or not — to you people?"]],[493,["Or do you want more proofs?"]],[495,["Now it is proved that “Mother sees much beyond us,"]],[498,["and whatever She sees happens.”"]],[501,["So anybody who tries to play tricks with Mother"]],[505,["is actually playing tricks with himself."]],[509,["Any tricks you try to play with Me, or you think"]],[512,["that “Mother is very forgiving, so She will forgive us” —"]],[515,["is really you are torturing yourself,"]],[518,["you are… it is detrimental to you."]],[520,["Many people are there who will say that “It is my Left Swadisthana.”"]],[524,["Some will say, “I was possessed; there was bhoot.”"]],[527,["Somebody will blame something else."]],[529,["Whatever you are blaming —"]],[531,["actually, who is asking you the explanation?"]],[534,["It’s only you asking yourself."]],[537,["You are not facing yourself."]],[543,["So the devotion to Me means actually facing to yourself."]],[549,["You face yourself first of all,"]],[551,["and see for yourself what are you doing."]],[555,["You are your own enemy; nobody is your enemy."]],[559,["Your Mother is not, definitely. She’s not your enemy by any chance."]],[565,["And no bhoots are your enemies — in the way,"]],[568,["if you do not allow them, they can’t be there."]],[573,["No evil person is your enemy,"]],[575,["because he cannot be effective if you are spiritually equipped."]],[581,["So you are your own enemy, is decided now."]],[586,["The only way to get rid of that enemy of yours -"]],[590,["you have to dedicate."]],[592,["Supposing you say"]],[595,["that “I have faith in Mother,” or “in God.”"]],[602,["So you are holding on to something, isn’t it?"]],[605,["And you are discarding something."]],[608,["But this hold has to be very strong."]],[610,["Rationally, if you at that time when you are sinking,"]],[613,["will you rationalize, “Whether I should hold the hand"]],[616,["of this person who is saving, is correct or not?”"]],[619,["No, you’ll just… your grip will be very strong."]],[623,["It will be extremely strong,"]],[624,["and you will grip it with full force, with full faith —"]],[628,["that “Some or other, save me!”"]],[632,["And that kind of a feeling should be within us"]],[636,["that “I am a person who is sinking because of myself."]],[643,["And if I am to be saved, I have to be absolutely,"]],[650,["completely submerged in Sahaja Yoga."]],[656,["Absolutely I have to become one with it,"]],[660,["then only I can be saved.”"]],[661,["Because at this level,"]],[663,["where you are realized souls of a higher level…"]],[667,["now for a next jump, as I was saying to you — is devotion."]],[672,["Anything else has to be secondary, under the circumstances."]],[678,["If it is primary"]],[681,["and your attention is still on that,"]],[685,["then you cannot have this second jump."]],[687,["First jump you have already done, you have got your Realization."]],[690,["But from first jump to second jump —"]],[694,["you’ve worked hard, you have come to the second jump —"]],[697,["in the second jump, you have to face it up."]],[701,["You should not feel disgusted with yourself"]],[704,["nor dejected with yourself for nothing."]],[706,["But treat yourself as a separate entity."]],[711,["And dedication is, actually, turning back to yourself"]],[715,["and looking forward"]],[717,["towards the divine personality in you."]],[722,["Once there is divine personality in you,"]],[725,["there’s no problem of devotion."]],[727,["You’ll just become one with it; you’ll start enjoying it."]],[732,["But this rationality is the worst thing,"]],[736,["that plays tricks with you,"]],[738,["which deviates you from understanding"]],[741,["that whatever life you have led so far"]],[745,["has been on a very material, gross life."]],[748,["You came out of it, you have grown out of it, you have come up."]],[753,["Now, to blossom, to become fragrant,"]],[762,["you have to give up rationality. That’s a binding [POINT?]."]],[768,["Try to avoid rationality, try to avoid arguments,"]],[773,["try to avoid giving reasons and…"]],[776,["Even now I find sometimes Sahaja Yogis give"]],[779,["an explanation of psychology:"]],[782,["“She might be insecured, Mother.”"]],[785,["This is typically somewhere read in the book:"]],[788,["“Because of insecurity, somebody does that.”"]],[790,["Actually, now we have seen in Sahaja Yoga"]],[793,["that most of the so-called insecured are the most aggressive people."]],[797,["They play tricks with others, spoil their lives — and enjoy it."]],[802,["They are the greatest sadists ever born."]],[806,["We have seen these people."]],[807,["“She is inse…” — and that’s how they play tricks with themselves."]],[813,["Now, once you understand"]],[817,["that you are not to play tricks with yourself…"]],[819,["why do you want to play tricks with yourself?"]],[824,["You have to be yourself, that’s all."]],[826,["We should not be our own enemies. Are we?"]],[830,["So, once you start facing yourself, you will like yourself."]],[834,["You won’t feel disgusted."]],[835,["Because that what “yourself” I’m talking about"]],[838,["is glorious, is beautiful,"]],[840,["is without any kalanka [blemish] on that, is absolutely detached."]],[846,["But, first of all, your attention has to accept it —"]],[850,["that “This detachment is my life; I’m a different personality now."]],[855,["Detachment is my nourishment.”"]],[862,["Detach yourself."]],[864,["One gentleman came to see Me in My house."]],[866,["I had a very beautiful lamp, and he liked it."]],[868,["I said, “You have it.” He was so amazed, you see."]],[871,["Wife telephoned to Me: “How could it be?"]],[873,["How could You give away such a nice thing?” I said, “What’s there?"]],[876,["Am I going to carry it with Me when I die?"]],[879,["Is it going to go with Me? Just see rationally."]],[882,["If he has liked it, better have it."]],[883,["I have so many lamps in the house;"]],[884,["if he takes one, what does it matter?”"]],[888,["She said, “But, You see, I asked my husband,"]],[890,["‘Will you give this lamp — like this if you had — to Her?’"]],[893,["He said, ‘No, I would not.’"]],[897,["‘I’m really… I would not’, he said.”"]],[899,["He was very honest. He said, “I would not.”"]],[901,["But still, I can’t understand why not?"]],[906,["So, you know, till the last end"]],[908,["we are holding on to something very little there."]],[912,["This… even a little bit is holding the sari."]],[916,["You know that, that can hold the whole sari."]],[919,["Even a little bit is attaching to this sari —"]],[923,["the sari can be held back."]],[925,["The whole thing you can hold it with one little pin."]],[928,["All these small pins that are there — the hangs-up —"]],[933,["are to be denied, to be seen… going further."]],[938,["Look at yourself: “Oh, that’s Mr. Ego?"]],[940,["All right, now recede; let me see how do you go back.”"]],[945,["To see all those things…"]],[946,["you see, as a play, you should see yourself."]],[949,["And then play tricks with your ego and superego."]],[953,["Actually, they’re playing tricks with you."]],[955,["Once you are a master, you play tricks with them."]],[960,["So many times I have seen:"]],[964,["I’ve said so many things, and they are again…"]],[968,["then, after some time, people start talking about it."]],[972,["Within one or two months after that,"]],[974,["it comes as a scientific proof or things like that."]],[976,["You have seen that, many a times it has happened."]],[980,["Now, when I say something, I’m sure about it, what I say."]],[982,["I never say anything but the truth."]],[984,["I know that I am saying only the truth."]],[986,["But I do not go inside and find out whether it is the truth or not."]],[991,["I don’t read a book to find out. I don’t ask you."]],[994,["I have faith in Myself, full faith in Myself."]],[997,["Whatever I say is the truth;"]],[999,["I know for definite that I… whatever I say comes out truth."]],[1005,["But that’s not your case."]],[1008,["That’s not your case, that whatever you say is the truth."]],[1012,["So first you have to establish this state —"]],[1015,["that “Whatever I say will be the truth.”"]],[1018,["Now, how do you do it? The tongue should be such"]],[1022,["that whatever you say should be the truth."]],[1024,["Ultimately, it will come out as truth."]],[1028,["And that is why the dedication should be there."]],[1032,["What dedication? “Why should I tell lies?”"]],[1041,["There is no need to tell lies."]],[1045,["Even if I tell lies, it will come truth — in My case."]],[1048,["So-called lies. They are never lies."]],[1053,["If I say to somebody, “He is a bad man” —"]],[1056,["apparently to you: “Oh, Mother, he is such a fine man!"]],[1061,["How can You say such a thing about him?”"]],[1064,["We had one Mr. Michael like that."]],[1066,["“Oh, he is such a loving person, Mother.”"]],[1070,["Somebody said, “Mother, are you jealous of him?”"]],[1074,["Up to that extent, you know."]],[1077,["But when he showed his real teeth, you see, then people knew."]],[1082,["So, to develop that kind of understanding about the truth,"]],[1088,["first of all, you should absolutely fix yourself on the truth."]],[1094,["And the truth is that you are the instrument of God,"]],[1097,["that you have got Realization,"]],[1099,["that you have got a special awareness,"]],[1104,["which people do not have. Stand on that."]],[1109,["And proclaim it. You are not to be afraid of it."]],[1112,["You have got Realization, no doubt. You have felt it."]],[1115,["Say it: “I’ve got Realization."]],[1117,["Nothing doing, I know I’m a realized soul.” Firm on that."]],[1122,["In this expression of truth, you have to be like the light."]],[1127,["The light asserts."]],[1129,["It not only asserts but it shows others also that it shines."]],[1134,["It shows others that “I am the light,”"]],[1138,["that “You walk in my light,"]],[1141,["and if you don’t try to do it, I may burn you.”"]],[1146,["So they have that… what you call, that…"]],[1151,["I don’t know what’s the word is… Tejasvita. Tejas."]],[1156,["Sharpness of light."]],[1158,["That tejasvita is there, that sharpness of light."]],[1161,["That is the proof of your truth."]],[1164,["You are not afraid of any prime minister,"]],[1166,["or any minister, or any king, or anyone."]],[1169,["But — “This is the fact. That’s the thing."]],[1172,["I know I am a realized soul, I am the truth.”"]],[1178,["If you say, “I’m the truth,” whatever you will say"]],[1182,["will be the truth, no doubt about it."]],[1187,["Whatever you will do will be the truth. But say, “I’m the truth.”"]],[1191,["But for that, a real purification is needed"]],[1194,["about facing yourself fully, in dedication."]],[1199,["Means you are holding on to your Mother,"]],[1201,["you are holding on to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1203,["you are holding on to that truth which you have found out."]],[1206,["And here you are facing others."]],[1209,["Without that you cannot do it; your source is that."]],[1213,["You are standing on the truth."]],[1216,["And that is such a power, such a strength."]],[1223,["All of them if you see — Christ had that power,"]],[1225,["Mohammed had that power — all these great people had that power"]],[1228,["to say the truth, with full courage,"]],[1234,["with that assertion that people will accept it."]],[1238,["And they would suffer even for that, they wouldn’t mind."]],[1240,["But whatever is the truth has to be said."]],[1242,["That’s the first point one should know about dedication —"]],[1247,["that you are dedicated fully,"]],[1249,["that you are not afraid of anyone."]],[1253,["You are not worried about your losses."]],[1257,["Some people have lost their heads also,"]],[1259,["completely cut their heads. People have tortured them."]],[1263,["Some people have been… taken away all their money,"]],[1266,["have been tortured in every way,"]],[1268,["but they thought this was the truth, they stood by it."]],[1270,["Some of them were stupid fools; they stood for something"]],[1273,["that was not truth. They did."]],[1275,["But now you know that you are standing on the truth,"]],[1278,["and for that, you should be willing to sacrifice anything —"]],[1281,["so-called sacrifice, because you are not sacrificing the truth."]],[1286,["What you had tried sacrificing is untruth."]],[1289,["For that, you require people of strength and courage,"]],[1292,["and not these half-baked people."]],[1295,["You see, till morning till evening"]],[1297,["asking for forgiveness from Mother. What is it?"]],[1300,["What is there to ask for forgiveness —"]],[1302,["because I am forgiving you every moment."]],[1305,["But what are you doing to yourself? What sort of a person you are?"]],[1311,["You think about it, that you have to stand on the truth."]],[1313,["For that, you have to be a strong, courageous person"]],[1318,["with that sharpness, that tejasvita within you —"]],[1322,["of the light of the beacon."]],[1325,["But at the same time, you have to have complete dedication."]],[1329,["Supposing there is no oil in this — it will all go off."]],[1333,["It has to have oil."]],[1336,["It will go off."]],[1338,["So the dedication part is the oil in you,"]],[1341,["is the attachment, complete attachment to your source."]],[1347,["That’s the dedication."]],[1349,["But that dedication should not give you"]],[1352,["any other ideas but of a light which shines,"]],[1359,["which corrects others, guides the path of other people."]],[1366,["If that is not so, then the source that you are tapping"]],[1370,["is not coming to you fully,"]],[1373,["and that your light is not burning properly."]],[1380,["So, into dedication when you go,"]],[1387,["you must not think that it is any surrendering —"]],[1391,["the so-called surrendering, that you become like a cabbage."]],[1395,["That’s the idea people have — that you become like cabbage."]],[1398,["But you become dynamic."]],[1404,["You become real power —"]],[1409,["not of destruction but of construction."]],[1412,["I mean, for destruction you don’t need much power."]],[1415,["Only for construction you need power."]],[1417,["For destruction how much do you need? Very little."]],[1420,["You can destroy the whole thing in no time."]],[1423,["But for the construction you really require great power."]],[1431,["And that power — sustained power,"]],[1434,["or flowing power — has to be there."]],[1438,["For that, dedication is needed."]],[1441,["Holding on to your source of power,"]],[1445,["you have to stand firm, courageously,"]],[1449,["without any fear."]],[1457,["That’s the truth."]],[1460,["That’s the truth you have to achieve."]],[1463,["That’s very important."]],[1465,["But this is only one side of the story."]],[1470,["That’s not sufficient. Just being the truth,"]],[1475,["the aspect of one side is there."]],[1480,["But the other side of it is"]],[1482,["that when this source comes to you, you become the compassion."]],[1489,["The truth and the compassion are one thing."]],[1492,["You won’t believe, but it is so."]],[1494,["Like the wick and the oil combine to form the light."]],[1501,["It is the burning of the oil gives you the light."]],[1506,["In the same way, the compassion gives you the truth."]],[1511,["There’s no difference whatsoever. Only the state is different —"]],[1516,["that you cannot see the light, which is oil,"]],[1520,["and oil, which is burning."]],[1524,["So compassion is the one which is the source,"]],[1531,["as well as your store."]],[1534,["So, from the source of compassion,"]],[1538,["you get your compassion."]],[1541,["You see, I have seen people — they want to have compassion from Me,"]],[1545,["they want that I should love them."]],[1548,["But — reflect it back — do they love others like that?"]],[1552,["I have known people, they have…"]],[1554,["say, for one person says harsh thing to another,"]],[1558,["and comes and asks Me, “Mother, forgive me for that,”"]],[1561,["or does something harsh just for the whim of the mind."]],[1565,["“Mother, forgive me.”"]],[1567,["But when you ask for that, I would like to know:"]],[1571,["have you given compassion to another person?"]],[1575,["Even after getting forgiveness from Me —"]],[1577,["that Source of forgiveness, that Source of compassion —"]],[1582,["have you given compassion to others?"]],[1585,["Have you been compassionate to others?"]],[1587,["You see, it should not be one-sided."]],[1591,["If you are taking the advantage of My compassion,"]],[1595,["it should not be one-sided,"]],[1596,["that you use it for your own benefit and forget about it."]],[1600,["Then you will never grow. You will never grow."]],[1605,["If you have to grow, then you must store that compassion within you."]],[1610,["Whatever compassion I’ve given you, love I’ve given you,"]],[1613,["you must store that within you — and give that back to others."]],[1620,["Otherwise you will be finished, you will be nowhere."]],[1625,["Is the growth which is sustained only…"]],[1631,["not only by sucking from one side but by giving to others."]],[1635,["Otherwise you’ll be stagnated."]],[1639,["There has to be outflow."]],[1642,["But that is a very hard thing"]],[1645,["because people are very good at taking compassion from Mother."]],[1650,["Or even if they are compassionate,"]],[1652,["they will be mostly compassionate to people who are, say…"]],[1660,["in, say, Vietnam — not in the ashram."]],[1665,["They are more worried about Vietnam people, you know:"]],[1667,["“Oh, Mother, we are worried about Vietnam people,"]],[1670,["we are collecting money for them,"]],[1672,["we are trying to send money to Vietnam.”"]],[1673,["And here among ashramites — fighting."]],[1679,["This is not compassion by any chance."]],[1682,["Sahaja Yogis among themselves are a different race,"]],[1685,["and they are to support each other all the time,"]],[1689,["and look after them."]],[1690,["When I find Sahaja Yogis criticizing Sahaja Yogis, I’m amazed."]],[1695,["I’m really amazed."]],[1696,["Because you are part and parcel of the same."]],[1700,["How can you criticize? One eye criticizing another person —"]],[1703,["I just can’t understand."]],[1707,["I can criticize, all right, but why should you?"]],[1711,["Why should you criticize each other?"]],[1714,["Only thing that you have to do is to love each other."]],[1718,["Christ has said it thrice,"]],[1720,["I must have said it a hundred and eight times already —"]],[1723,["that you have to love each other."]],[1726,["That is the only way you are expressing compassion."]],[1729,["If I’ve given you any love any time,"]],[1732,["you have to have patience with others, love for others."]],[1736,["I sometimes try to coax people,"]],[1739,["and I find that people immediately come out"]],[1744,["with some sort of a criticism of others, or something like that."]],[1749,["Now, the basic thing is that our compassion,"]],[1756,["if that is flowing,"]],[1762,["then only we can get compassion from Mother."]],[1767,["There is no place any more; I’ve done too much compassion business."]],[1772,["And what I find that now unless and until you flow it,"]],[1775,["how am I to give you compassion? I mean, there is no space left now."]],[1779,["So better give it away, empty yourself a little bit,"]],[1781,["then I can give you more compassion."]],[1789,["It’s simple business."]],[1790,["In this respect, one has to understand"]],[1793,["that the source cannot flow"]],[1798,["unless and until it expands the flow of it."]],[1803,["Like the river Thames. We went to see the river Thames,"]],[1806,["the place from where it starts."]],[1808,["It’s a small, little stream from seven streams —"]],[1811,["little little, very little little — we can say, trickling down."]],[1815,["And it has become a river Thames."]],[1817,["Supposing it does not widens —"]],[1821,["that will stop at the beginning only."]],[1824,["It cannot come out, it cannot flow."]],[1827,["It’s not because it is angry, or upset, or anything like that,"]],[1831,["but by the nature of its flow only"]],[1835,["it cannot flow, what to do?"]],[1841,["So, that is what it is —"]],[1844,["that one has to give compassion to others."]],[1848,["It should not be formal compassion, or affected one,"]],[1852,["but should be a natural one, very natural,"]],[1855,["spontaneous, feeling from within."]],[1858,["It’s not an expression of your ego,"]],[1860,["or superego, or over-sentimentality,"]],[1863,["but is a kind of a understanding that he is a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1866,["you are a Sahaja Yogi, you are brothers."]],[1869,["Not the way the brothers have been"]],[1871,["but a different type of brothers who are spiritual brothers."]],[1876,["You are spiritual people."]],[1878,["So this compassion has to be there,"]],[1882,["and unless and until you develop that compassionate,"]],[1885,["fatherly or motherly feelings for others…"]],[1889,["I mean, I am a Mother of a person"]],[1891,["who is about hundred and eight years of age."]],[1894,["You have to really mother others,"]],[1897,["and have that feeling of compassion and love for others."]],[1901,["You don’t have to think about your own comfort,"]],[1903,["you don’t have to think about your own advantages,"]],[1906,["but you have to think about the comfort of others."]],[1909,["You have to think what you can do to make others comfortable,"]],[1913,["than to see what will make you comfortable."]],[1918,["So this flow of compassion, when it starts, you see,"]],[1922,["the dedication is complete."]],[1926,["Because “whatever we got from You, Mother,"]],[1930,["we are giving it to others.” That’s the dedication."]],[1933,["So the flow of dedication is not one-sided."]],[1939,["It is double-sided."]],[1942,["You stick on to something,"]],[1944,["you get connected with something to get something out of it,"]],[1947,["and you give it to others."]],[1950,["And ultimately that reaches the collective being —"]],[1953,["means it reaches the source."]],[1958,["It is in this light we have to understand."]],[1961,["Exclusiveness, or “We should — now married —"]],[1964,["we should have separate place,"]],[1966,["we should live separately” — it’s all right,"]],[1968,["you must have little privacy as a married people,"]],[1971,["I’m not saying that."]],[1973,["But as far as compassion is concerned,"]],[1976,["as married people you have to be much more compassionate."]],[1980,["But you’ll only worry about your own children,"]],[1983,["about your own comfort,"]],[1986,["about your own husband, about your own wife."]],[1990,["In Sahaja Yoga, there is no place for such people."]],[1996,["It’s all collective."]],[1998,["When you bring sweets for your own child,"]],[2000,["bring for other children in the ashram."]],[2003,["You are one family,"]],[2005,["and all the family has to move with the same waves."]],[2008,["I had told you before"]],[2009,["that we cannot have separate food arrangements,"]],[2012,["separate this and separate that."]],[2014,["In the same way, we cannot have separate standards"]],[2018,["of living for different people."]],[2022,["We all have to enjoy whatever is enjoyed by all of you."]],[2027,["That should be so."]],[2029,["And that should be achieved on material level."]],[2032,["On emotional level, any marriage which is absurd,"]],[2036,["which makes everyone unhappy is useless."]],[2040,["But marriages are made to make everyone happy."]],[2044,["So, before you decide to marry,"]],[2047,["think that you are not playing tricks."]],[2051,["Playing tricks in Sahaja Yoga is very, very dangerous."]],[2055,["You are not playing tricks with your marriages;"]],[2058,["you are not trying to involve somebody else,"]],[2061,["thinking that Mother will forgive you and all that."]],[2063,["I will forgive. But your ascent is difficult."]],[2067,["So don’t try to play tricks with anything"]],[2070,["that you have been doing before,"]],[2072,["but change yourself completely, transform yourself completely."]],[2077,["Now you change your attitude towards life."]],[2081,["You can because it is changed already."]],[2083,["If you try to be the other person, you cannot be."]],[2086,["Now you have become a flower, now you can’t become"]],[2088,["suddenly the leaf."]],[2090,["Now you are a flower, and you have to live like a flower."]],[2095,["And that’s what you have to remember —"]],[2097,["that compassion is such an outflow,"]],[2103,["is such a natural thing for a Sahaja Yogi."]],[2107,["It’s not natural for anybody else."]],[2110,["Other people who talk of compassion, or this and that,"]],[2113,["are actually… are not at all compassionate."]],[2116,["They are doing it for money; they are doing it for position;"]],[2119,["they are doing for ego satisfaction."]],[2121,["But you are having compassion"]],[2123,["because you have to have it, jolly well."]],[2126,["It is flowing, the compassion — because it has to flow."]],[2130,["And you are doing compassion because of compassion."]],[2135,["There is no other purpose behind it."]],[2138,["Only this will give you something"]],[2142,["that is of permanent nature, of a sthayi nature."]],[2145,["I’ve seen people — as I was telling in the morning —"]],[2149,["who have gone to an organization,"]],[2150,["made a beautiful organization out of it,"]],[2153,["and once they leave, the organization is finished."]],[2155,["Because they do not give anything substantial to that organization."]],[2159,["And what is to be given is a large heart of compassion."]],[2163,["If you do not give that,"]],[2165,["once you go away from that, the rest of them are again barren."]],[2169,["It’s not a growth."]],[2171,["Like if you bring water, and plant things,"]],[2174,["and give water to that area, then it becomes very beautiful,"]],[2180,["and you can say it’s a very lush growth."]],[2185,["But as soon as that water source is removed,"]],[2191,["it gets again dried out."]],[2193,["But Sahaja Yoga is different."]],[2195,["In Sahaja Yoga you not only grow as a plant"]],[2200,["but also as the source of the plant."]],[2206,["If this plant is removed from here, put somewhere,"]],[2208,["it will give water to other plants."]],[2211,["Do you know this new dimension that you have within yourself?"]],[2214,["That once this plant is uprooted from here and taken out,"]],[2218,["it will not die, not at all. It will grow."]],[2221,["But it will make others grow."]],[2224,["This is another type of a growth that we have."]],[2229,["And it’s a very different position we are in."]],[2232,["And that’s what now I want — that all of you,"]],[2235,["even if you are uprooted and put into any other place…"]],[2240,["I’ve seen, when I ask people"]],[2242,["that “You better shift from here to there,”"]],[2244,["they just get frightened."]],[2247,["“You better go there and do this” — they get frightened."]],[2252,["You are a plant which can not only go and prosper in any place"]],[2256,["but you will give"]],[2260,["the necessary nourishment to other plants."]],[2263,["That’s what you are."]],[2266,["So do not stick on to one place. If you stick on, then"]],[2269,["think there must be something wrong with the place."]],[2272,["Like a glue if you are sticking to one place, it’s very dangerous."]],[2276,["And be sure that you must turn"]],[2279,["away from such a place which glues you."]],[2281,["That does not mean that, as people are here,"]],[2283,["they never stay in the house, they all the time running out."]],[2285,["It doesn’t mean. Again I have to strike that point."]],[2288,["Because otherwise the people are here…"]],[2290,["are all the time running away from their houses."]],[2292,["That’s not the point."]],[2293,["The point is that you should not be glued to anything"]],[2297,["and not afraid of leaving any place,"]],[2299,["because now you are Sahaja Yogis."]],[2302,["You have joined the ocean, and ocean can take you anywhere."]],[2306,["So just prepare yourself to move into any place"]],[2309,["because you have to take this compassion everywhere."]],[2315,["And to prosper the Kingdom of God,"]],[2321,["you have to serve Him."]],[2323,["And this service only possible if you know"]],[2326,["that you are here for a very great, universal task."]],[2332,["Not only for England, for India, or for America,"]],[2338,["but you are here for a global task,"]],[2341,["which is the epitome of our evolution."]],[2344,["This is the highest thing we have to do"]],[2346,["for our Creation and for our Creator,"]],[2350,["and you are chosen for that."]],[2352,["So don’t divert your attention to anything"]],[2356,["that is not fulfilling your own manifestation."]],[2362,["Discard all that. Don’t waste your energy."]],[2365,["And your manifestation is your compassion, your love."]],[2373,["But still, it should not remain rational."]],[2377,["Whatever I have said to you is just to put you into a condition"]],[2382,["where you start sucking the vibrations"]],[2384,["as well as giving the vibrations."]],[2387,["It is an action,"]],[2389,["which is a happening that should take place within you."]],[2393,["It’s not rationality, it’s not thinking about it."]],[2396,["Only by saying these things I really stun your thinking."]],[2399,["You should allow this to happen to you."]],[2402,["Just with the vibratory awareness you should judge yourself:"]],[2409,["“Am I the one who is giving vibrations to others?"]],[2413,["Am I the one who has stored these vibrations,"]],[2415,["or am I getting ruined?”"]],[2419,["All this will give you a great meaning —"]],[2422,["and an employment. As I said, “employed by God.”"]],[2428,["If you have any questions, ask Me."]],[2448,["YOGI: Mother, if you become angry at any point with people,"]],[2452,["is that because it’s a tendency"]],[2454,["or a negative entity?"]],[2457,["Or is it just a tendency to react like that?"]],[2461,["SHRI MATAJI: You see, if you get angry within yourself,"]],[2466,["and if you are sure that you are not doing anything wrong,"]],[2469,["for a Sahaja Yogi there is no need to say outside you are angry."]],[2473,["There’s no need. That anger itself is a power."]],[2477,["And you should do your bandhan and anything that you want to do."]],[2482,["But you should not show that you are angry."]],[2488,["You should be absolutely silent. Because you can be;"]],[2490,["you are in the axis, you are not on the periphery."]],[2493,["Actually, the anger is just to see your anger"]],[2495,["and use that anger for that purpose."]],[2500,["And once you start doing that, that anger will itself work out."]],[2509,["That anger will itself work out the person."]],[2511,["And you’ll be amazed how it… but you must learn to see your anger"]],[2515,["that is working."]],[2517,["All these things are important. You have seen that sometimes"]],[2520,["only shouting at the bhoots — they go away."]],[2522,["And many mad people have been cured like that."]],[2525,["But you don’t do all that, that’s for Me."]],[2527,["You must be always decent, with decorum and all that."]],[2532,["But if the anger is because of your nature,"]],[2535,["or a tendency, or out of control — than it’s a bad thing."]],[2539,["If it is an out-of-control, than it’s a bad thing."]],[2542,["If you get into a temper because it is out of control,"]],[2546,["than it’s a bad thing. I can get very angry,"]],[2549,["but I am completely under control: I know I am angry,"]],[2552,["where the bhoot is, how he is running away; I can see it."]],[2556,["But you can’t see the bhoot, you can’t see anything."]],[2559,["So there is no need for you to get angry, show temper."]],[2564,["But if you have an anger —"]],[2566,["say, for example, which makes you uncontrollable —"]],[2570,["then there is a mantra for that: Shanti [peace]."]],[2573,["“Ya Devi sarva bhuteshu Shanti rupena samsthita.”"]],[2578,["You must ask for that bliss, for that peace."]],[2581,["This is a mantra for you."]],[2583,["For controlling your temper, you have to tell yourself,"]],[2586,["“Ya Devi sarva bhuteshu Shanti rupena samsthita.”"]],[2591,["So Shanti is the point — the axis point is that —"]],[2594,["from where you witness everything."]],[2596,["You are in Shanti, you are in complete…"]],[2599,["you are not in a turmoil even if you are angry."]],[2602,["You are not in a turmoil. Whatever is anger is the power,"]],[2605,["and the power is taking charge."]],[2607,["But unless and until that is achieved, what you have to do is to put"]],[2612,["yourself in a position that you are peaceful."]],[2614,["So I think that’s a very good mantra —"]],[2617,["is to say, “Ya Devi sarva bhuteshu Shanti rupena samsthita.”"]],[2622,["Can you say that?"]],[2638,["So the Shanti is your fort."]],[2641,["But peacefulness never means cowardice."]],[2644,["Never call cowardice as peace."]],[2649,["A person who is peaceful is never coward,"]],[2651,["because nothing can transgress it, nothing can overpower it."]],[2655,["It is never never"]],[2657,["possible that cowardice and peace can go together."]],[2661,["But your power is inside, not outside."]],[2664,["So you don’t show your power of your anger outside."]],[2668,["But just little anger with anybody — you will see it will work out."]],[2677,["But first establish that…"]],[2679,["that position within you where you are the axis,"]],[2682,["where you do not allow anger to sit on your head."]],[2687,["That is the growth. That is the growth, that you are at peace."]],[2692,["Also… Another question? All right, satisfied now?"]],[2697,["Both ways you should know:"]],[2699,["that one is the anger that is detached — is perfectly all right;"]],[2703,["anger which involves you — work it out."]],[2707,["So judge yourself as to what it is."]],[2710,["Good question."]],[2726,["Ask some questions."]],[2729,["I mean, such intellectuals sitting here."]],[2732,["Ask Me some questions what is there."]],[2737,["YOGI: Mother, [HAVE YOU PREPARED?] Your plans"]],[2740,["to spread Sahaja Yoga [IN OUTER SCALE?]?"]],[2743,["SHRI MATAJI: What are My plans?"]],[2745,["I don’t plan. You see, I don’t plan, because I don’t know"]],[2749,["how far My instruments are ready, you see."]],[2754,["First, now My only plans — if I have any —"]],[2757,["is to really prepare My weapons all right."]],[2759,["Once they are done, then we’ll fix them up."]],[2763,["You see, unless and until you know how far your bomb can fall,"]],[2767,["how can you plan it?"]],[2772,["So, first of all, I must measure up"]],[2774,["the power of My children, how powerful they are."]],[2778,["That’s what I’m trying to do now —"]],[2779,["is to make them aware of their powers to use."]],[2783,["Like, you see, Hanumana, when He was born and when He grew up,"]],[2787,["He forgot that time, and He forgot His powers."]],[2791,["So He was to be reminded"]],[2792,["that “You are such and such powerful person."]],[2795,["You don’t know what your powers are, you…"]],[2797,["you ate of the whole of Surya."]],[2799,["This you did in your childhood. You are born with this power,"]],[2802,["but now, after growing,"]],[2804,["you are… rather bit… sort of forgotten it,"]],[2808,["and also you were afraid of using them, and it’s…"]],[2813,["sort of looks like in the dominant position."]],[2817,["But it is there. If you just try to remember them, it will come up.”"]],[2821,["They have tremendous power, these people have tremendous power."]],[2824,["But they have to assume and stand on that."]],[2827,["If they do not do it…"]],[2828,["You see, if I tell them, “Now, go to this house” —"]],[2832,["“Oh, Mother, there may be a bhoot there sitting.”"]],[2841,["A person comes possessed in the ashram —"]],[2843,["they all shut their doors: “Oh God, this bhoot has come.”"]],[2847,["Or something — then worse."]],[2855,["YOGI: Mother, may I ask You something?"]],[2859,["How can we deal with… You see, there is one problem in…"]],[2862,["one big problem in Sahaja Yoga, You know."]],[2865,["It’s… those who are devoted to You at the expense of others."]],[2869,["SHRI MATAJI: Those who are devoted to Me…"]],[2871,["YOGI: Or those who use the excuse of their devoting to You, Mother,"]],[2876,["sometimes to oppress others."]],[2878,["SHRI MATAJI: They are what?"]],[2879,["YOGI: Sometimes people use their devotion to You"]],[2884,["as… at the expense of others, or…"]],[2889,["SHRI MATAJI:Then again the same thing, Djamel, is the same thing is."]],[2892,["You see, it is… you have to do it, all those who are doing that way."]],[2896,["I’m just pointing out to all those."]],[2899,["If you are using, say, your devotion to Me"]],[2904,["for the oppressing of others, all right?"]],[2907,["So it is for you to see."]],[2910,["There is nobody who can be oppressed,"]],[2912,["because your Spirit cannot be oppressed."]],[2917,["Say, there is X and Y."]],[2918,["Now, Y is a person who’s trying to oppress X, all right?"]],[2923,["What will you oppress? He can’t oppress his Spirit, can he?"]],[2928,["First point. Clear."]],[2930,["Now, this fellow, if he has to have"]],[2935,["attachment to Me, nobody can stop him."]],[2938,["There is all… you all have direct relationship with Me."]],[2941,["Not through anyone."]],[2942,["If you want to accept somebody’s agency, then I can’t help you."]],[2946,["But, otherwise, you all have a direct access to Me."]],[2950,["You all can grow your Spirits; nobody can dominate you."]],[2953,["Everyone has complete freedom to grow their Spirit —"]],[2957,["to know their Spirit, I mean to say."]],[2959,["And the Spirit is something… cannot be dominated by anyone."]],[2964,["Now, supposing somebody tries to oppress you."]],[2967,["What will they oppress you, in which way?"]],[2968,["They’ll say, “All right, we’ll not have this carpet,"]],[2970,["we’ll have that carpet.” Have it!"]],[2973,["Somebody will say, “I’ll jump in the sea.” Jump! Just now you jump!"]],[2979,["What will they oppress you in? You see, just see that."]],[2982,["Not in your spiritual growth. Can they?"]],[2987,["And that’s how the problem starts."]],[2989,["You see, in material things…"]],[2991,["say, in an ashram now somebody says,"]],[2993,["“All right, we would like to have a photograph of Mother put there.”"]],[2998,["The other will say, “No, we are going to have it there.”"]],[3001,["Whether you put it here or there makes no difference."]],[3004,["My photograph is going to work it out."]],[3009,["Even in puja matters I’ve seen:"]],[3011,["people will say that “No, Mother is sitting there,"]],[3014,["don’t put your feet towards the Mother.”"]],[3016,["It is common thing; everybody knows should not put it."]],[3019,["But still they will say, “No, we want to put it.”"]],[3020,["All right, let them put it."]],[3022,["Next time they will not, because they will know it is wrong."]],[3026,["They will find out."]],[3027,["So, you see, nobody can oppress anyone."]],[3031,["I am here to correct. Once you understand"]],[3035,["that you are not perfect, the other is not perfect,"]],[3038,["we are all perfecting ourselves, we are all coming up,"]],[3041,["Mother is there to look after us —"]],[3043,["then we will never think like that."]],[3048,["Now. I’ve also seen, people will say"]],[3050,["that there are two Sahaja Yogis talking to others… Sahaja Yogis."]],[3055,["Now, one is a very oppressive one,"]],[3057,["the another one is upset to see that this one is oppressive."]],[3061,["Now, for that purpose, if you are quiet, silent —"]],[3064,["you will always dominate him."]],[3066,["People will listen to you, not to him."]],[3068,["But even if you start saying,"]],[3070,["“Oh, you don’t say like that,” this, this,"]],[3071,["they will think these are fighting cocks."]],[3076,["Then, at that time, you are wise at this thing —"]],[3078,["will even give him a chance to understand."]],[3082,["But what happens: one person dominates,"]],[3084,["another tries to dominate them by outward things."]],[3087,["And the whole show is over."]],[3090,["There is no need to dominate another person by outward things."]],[3094,["He will settle down by himself"]],[3096,["if you show your dignity of your silence"]],[3098,["and of your understanding of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3102,["There is no need just now to say,"]],[3104,["“Shut up, you sit down, you don’t do.” It’s absolutely wrong."]],[3108,["They do it, I’ve seen it. In My presence I’ve seen it."]],[3115,["Because we still live halfway there and halfway here."]],[3119,["The way we solve the problem… say, you have to do some business."]],[3123,["There are two people doing the business. One person says something,"]],[3126,["another says, “Why did you say like this, you shouldn’t say.”"]],[3128,["This person says to that person, “You shouldn’t correct me.”"]],[3131,["Like that the fight is on."]],[3133,["But that doesn’t help anyway… there also."]],[3136,["But in Sahaja Yoga it will never help."]],[3137,["The another person can only win over by his dignity."]],[3142,["By his quiet methods, by approaching a person properly."]],[3145,["That’s how the leaders will come up."]],[3150,["They won’t come up by shooting another person down,"]],[3152,["not at all by any chance. That’s not possible."]],[3155,["Is not good leadership."]],[3157,["Good leadership is judged the way you handle the situation,"]],[3164,["not the way you fight another man down."]],[3168,["So many times you have seen: I just keep quiet — it works out."]],[3171,["Not necessary that you should at that moment shout."]],[3175,["There’s no need."]],[3177,["And it creates a very bad impression and very bad leadership."]],[3183,["First of all, you cannot be dominated. This is one fact, is a truth."]],[3188,["You can grow in your spirituality,"]],[3190,["whatever people may try to dominate in the worldly things."]],[3194,["Thank God we don’t have any organization."]],[3196,["Thank God we don’t have secretaries, assistant secretaries,"]],[3201,["under-secretaries, by-secretaries,"]],[3204,["upper secretaries, lower secretaries — we don’t have any nonsense."]],[3207,["Otherwise, even that would have been dominating to people."]],[3210,["Then they would have fought that. So we don’t have that problem."]],[3214,["We don’t have any money problem,"]],[3215,["because we don’t have all these nonsensical ideas."]],[3219,["I’ve solved this problem by having no institutions, no positions."]],[3224,["Everybody has position."]],[3228,["But the greatest position is of your Spirit, which you establish."]],[3232,["The attention is not there, is more ego-oriented."]],[3235,["The whole stuff is ego-oriented."]],[3237,["You can’t fight ego with ego, you cannot."]],[3240,["You can only fight ego or superego with Spirit."]],[3247,["How much do I dominate you?"]],[3252,["I absorb all your aggression also."]],[3255,["And how much do I dominate you?"]],[3261,["If I have to correct you, I go forward and do it,"]],[3265,["and tell you that I’m correcting you, whether you like it or not."]],[3270,["And you see the result, it’s all right."]],[3272,["But if you have that capacity, do it."]],[3276,["Then there is lacking in you, that you cannot do that way,"]],[3280,["so be prepared not to, at least, spoil the show of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3286,["One person is talking too much? All right, the others will say,"]],[3289,["“He is good for nothing, but another one is a sensible one.”"]],[3292,["But if you both are fighting, then I don’t know."]],[3298,["That’s… doesn’t show any wisdom or growth, isn’t it?"]],[3303,["Does it?"]],[3312,["Those who think that by dominating in small small things"]],[3315,["you are going to achieve anything are wrong."]],[3320,["Actually, I’ve seen, My grandchildren are realized souls."]],[3324,["They are not bothered about these things, they don’t do this."]],[3327,["This kind of a fight they don’t have."]],[3329,["That “where to keep this”, “what to do this” — they don’t have."]],[3334,["Nothing."]],[3339,["At the most, they might fight for a chocolate"]],[3341,["or something, at the most."]],[3343,["But in spiritual matters, they never fight."]],[3348,["In spiritual matters they never fight."]],[3351,["That’s a place one should not fight,"]],[3354,["one should not argue. That’s the point not to be argued,"]],[3356,["because truth is one. What is there to argue?"]],[3359,["You have seen all these saints, you see,"]],[3362,["those who have talked about Me. What do they say?"]],[3364,["Everybody says the same thing about Me."]],[3367,["There cannot be any fight between saints, can there be?"]],[3370,["If the truth is one, how can there be fight?"]],[3372,["But because one is inadequate, another is dominating —"]],[3376,["both must achieve that state."]],[3380,["But the best is to be more dignified,"]],[3384,["more grown-up, more patronizing…"]],[3386,["People will definitely take to you"]],[3388,["because you will become the leader."]],[3398,["Arguments are not going to lead you anywhere,"]],[3401,["I can tell you this much."]],[3403,["No use arguing among yourself."]],[3407,["If you have to argue, you have to argue with others,"]],[3411,["not among yourself."]],[3416,["Otherwise now? What else?"]],[3446,["What is the thing? Any other question?"]],[3455,["YOGINI: Mother, would You please tell a little bit how…"]],[3460,["how we fight our ego with the Spirit?"]],[3463,["How would you do…"]],[3465,["SHRI MATAJI: How do we fight the ego…"]],[3466,["YOGINI: … ego with the Spirit."]],[3468,["SHRI MATAJI: You see, you should never fight ego."]],[3470,["If you try to fight, it will sit more on your head."]],[3474,["That’s not the way to fight it,"]],[3476,["that there is ego and you fight your ego:"]],[3478,["“Oh, I’m going to box you” — then it will grow more, you see."]],[3481,["The more you box it, the more it will grow. Never fight your ego."]],[3484,["Only way is to see it."]],[3489,["Your attention is very important, your attention is now enlightened."]],[3492,["Whatever you see, it comes to its right size."]],[3496,["It comes to its right side… size."]],[3500,["Say, ego — if it is overgrown, you just watch your ego."]],[3504,["That is, it is to watch yourself in the mirror,"]],[3506,["and you say, “Oh, Mr. Ego, how do you do?”"]],[3513,["Then it will come down. But don’t fight it. Just to be seen."]],[3521,["All kinds of egos could be there."]],[3523,["If you are overeducated, you are egoistical."]],[3526,["If you are uneducated, you are egoistical —"]],[3529,["because you must try to show that you are something."]],[3531,["All sorts of egos are there."]],[3534,["So best thing is to see for yourself;"]],[3535,["that’s why I say, “Face yourself.” “Yourself” means your Spirit."]],[3546,["YOGI: Mother, that goes the same for the superego?"]],[3550,["SHRI MATAJI: Yes, very much so."]],[3551,["For superego also — not to be frightened."]],[3554,["You should just say, “Get out!"]],[3555,["I can see you very clearly, you are there."]],[3558,["You get out from here! How dare you frighten me? I am the Spirit."]],[3561,["I am the Spirit, how dare you can do that?”"]],[3565,["That’s how."]],[3571,["You see, ego makes you idiotic. Absolutely."]],[3575,["Ego makes you idiotic, makes an idiot out of you, absolutely."]],[3579,["And the superego makes you a coward."]],[3585,["It makes you a coward. Now, how to fight it?"]],[3588,["“I’m not going to be an idiot” — if you say that, ego will go away."]],[3593,["If you want to be an idiot, then he’ll be there to help you."]],[3596,["If you want to be an idiot, all right, call Mr. Ego."]],[3599,["You’ll become an idiot, straightforward."]],[3601,["Is the easiest way. Easiest way."]],[3604,["If you want to become an idiot, simple thing is to call the ego."]],[3609,["“You come, Mr. Ego, and settle down in me” —"]],[3612,["and immediately… this is a very simple composition."]],[3616,["And superego… if you are a coward, then it sits on your head."]],[3619,["Say, “I am not going to be…”"]],[3622,["Ham Ksham, as I told you, the mantra on the Agnya is."]],[3625,["Either you have to say, “I am”;"]],[3628,["the other, I say, “I forgive you.”"]],[3635,["YOGI: Mother, may I ask you a question"]],[3637,["similar to what he said about superego?"]],[3640,["I’ll be particular."]],[3643,["I’m still having problems with my eating."]],[3649,["I’m eating a lot here"]],[3652,["but I’m very afraid (I’m laughing ’cause it is silly)"]],[3655,["that I’ll become fat."]],[3658,["And I’m very afraid; I think a lot about food, all the time. Yet I…"]],[3662,["… I know that with You nothing bad can happen to me."]],[3666,["SHRI MATAJI: All right, you do one thing just now."]],[3668,["You put your left hand towards Me and right hand outside."]],[3674,["She has a Hamsa here, [UNCLEAR]."]],[3677,["There. You see, the Hamsa."]],[3679,["Tell her to come down. Come in, come in."]],[3684,["Oh, I see. Sorry."]],[3687,["Put the Hamsa, I didn’t see it clearly."]],[3692,["Hello. [PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[3695,["[WE’VE BEEN?] waiting for you."]],[3698,["Come forward, you can come forward a little bit."]],[3700,["Lots of people are there."]],[3701,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[3713,["What’s the time now?"]],[3717,["YOGI: A quarter past nine."]],[3719,["SHRI MATAJI: Quarter past nine."]],[3737,["As I have told you,"]],[3739,["that relationship with yourself should be tyrannical."]],[3742,["You should lash it down."]],[3744,["You should absolutely make it clear to yourself"]],[3747,["that “I have to perfect myself if I have to give"]],[3750,["this my being to God. It has to be perfect.”"]],[3754,["Secondly, if you have to have relationship"]],[3757,["with others, it has to be ideal relationship."]],[3759,["Sahaja Yogi with Sahaja Yogi — means something great."]],[3764,["The greatest relationship is that."]],[3766,["With your sister, with your brother — it should be ideal."]],[3770,["And in collectivity we have to be pragmatic."]],[3774,["In collectivity we can change our course,"]],[3777,["we’ll take the way we like, the way it moves; we’ll manage it."]],[3781,["But otherwise…"]],[3783,["You see, for example, take a plane. It has the same thing."]],[3786,["Plane, when it is in the air, it can go wherever it likes."]],[3792,["But the screws that are fixed in a plane are ideally fixed."]],[3796,["They cannot just start… like a pilot seat doesn’t go to the back,"]],[3801,["and the back doesn’t come to the front, you see."]],[3803,["The relationship is maintained. All right?"]],[3807,["And the screws which are made,"]],[3809,["or anything that is made — is perfect."]],[3814,["But airplane is not fixed."]],[3816,["Airplane can go southward, northward… anywhere it wants to."]],[3820,["Only the things that are in it"]],[3822,["are correlated with each other in such proportion"]],[3825,["that they cannot budge from their ideal positions."]],[3831,["I’m giving this example because you are here."]],[3833,["You’ll understand it better now."]],[3835,["And these things that you have produced"]],[3838,["are themselves… are perfect."]],[3840,["If they are imperfect, there will be a problem."]],[3842,["It’s like that. If you understand"]],[3844,["this very simple thing about relations and attitudes,"]],[3849,["you will never have problems."]],[3851,["Your relationship with a Sahaja Yogi"]],[3853,["has to be absolutely ideal relationship."]],[3856,["Otherwise, some screw is loose."]],[3860,["Try to make it ideal. Say, there’s one person."]],[3863,["You find the person is too egoistical, or something."]],[3866,["Try to see what’s wrong with you, first of all:"]],[3869,["“Am I perfect? Am I all right?"]],[3871,["Or am I equally dominating, am I equally egoistical?"]],[3875,["All right, if I am, then I better correct myself."]],[3878,["But if I am not,"]],[3879,["if I am a good person, that way I’m not dominating —"]],[3882,["then I should try to bring down his ego"]],[3884,["by making sweet things to him, making nice relationship with him.”"]],[3890,["Try to be kind to him, so that his ego comes down."]],[3894,["Manage somehow or other to establish ideal relationship."]],[3897,["Is absolutely simple. I mean, I don’t understand"]],[3900,["what have I to tell in this thing. You know everything."]],[3903,["That it has to be proper."]],[3904,["Now see, the relationship between that and"]],[3906,["Me has to be proper, so that it doesn’t burn Me, isn’t it?"]],[3913,["It’s absolutely… in lifetime, also, we have to do the same thing —"]],[3917,["that relationship with each other has to be ideal"]],[3923,["to create the best results."]],[3928,["It is so practical;"]],[3929,["I don’t know what is there to tell in this thing."]],[3932,["And you have to be perfect because you are the unit."]],[3937,["And the whole thing can be pragmatic."]],[3939,["Then only it can be."]],[3941,["But here just the other way round. The screws are pragmatic,"]],[3947,["the relationship is imperfect,"]],[3954,["and the collectivity is absolutely static. Doesn’t move."]],[3960,["“The collectivity. After all, we are collective,"]],[3962,["bound to each other."]],[3964,["How can we move, Mother, we are static now."]],[3967,["We are bound to each other, we can’t move, you see.”"]],[3970,["Just like the Rock of Gibraltar."]],[3977,["Now, you’ve been an aeronautic engineer, you should understand this"]],[3984,["better than anybody else, this example."]],[3992,["What else is the question?"]],[3996,["How are you? All right? I’m asking."]],[4007,["What other question?"]],[4012,["YOGI: Shri Mataji, could You say something about"]],[4015,["maintaining our attention, so that it stays where it should"]],[4018,["and doesn’t get diverted into trivial things?"]],[4025,["SHRI MATAJI: Rustem has asked a very practical question,"]],[4027,["it’s true — that to keep the attention where it should be."]],[4032,["You see, for everything"]],[4034,["you have to do some exercise, abhyas."]],[4038,["Not before Realization — after Realization."]],[4043,["The best way is to learn how to watch yourself."]],[4048,["Just now sitting here, just put yourself into a position"]],[4051,["from where you watch yourself: “Now what am I doing?”"]],[4061,["This is the abhyas, this is the study."]],[4063,["Apart from mantras, apart from anything."]],[4066,["The abhyas is the practice, practice of becoming a witness."]],[4074,["And the witness is the Spirit state; then attention will not go."]],[4078,["I mean, you will see everything, it’s there,"]],[4080,["but attention will be inside."]],[4083,["Try to practice this: “Am I a witness?”"]],[4086,["Now, say, some people say, “Oh God, I had a horrible time."]],[4090,["Mother, this happened, that happened.”"]],[4092,["You see, you are not a witness."]],[4094,["How can you have a horrible time if you are the Spirit?"]],[4098,["You only have a horrible time when you are not the Spirit."]],[4101,["If you can watch the whole thing as a drama that is played,"]],[4104,["then you are not having a horrible time,"]],[4106,["but this outside of you is having horrible time,"]],[4109,["which you are watching."]],[4113,["That’s how the attention can be fixed very well"]],[4118,["if you practice abhyas,"]],[4120,["practice all the time to be witness."]],[4123,["Say, you go out, you see something."]],[4126,["Just try to see it, not to think about it."]],[4131,["Be a witness of the whole thing. The joy will be complete,"]],[4134,["and, also, you will become absolutely peaceful."]],[4138,["Your attention will be completely enlightened."]],[4141,["And then the inspiration you will get will be tremendous."]],[4159,["See, it’s working out. Working out. Try to watch."]],[4167,["And it has such a tremendous memory — if you know how to watch."]],[4171,["I mean, to Me, if I see something, I mean…"]],[4173,["to Me it’s just like a… film in My mind."]],[4178,["If I have seen this room now, I know what’s it in this, design —"]],[4181,["everything I know. How you are sitting, what pose you have taken,"]],[4184,["how you wear, what was it — everything is like a design."]],[4188,["You see, it comes to Me just like a picture. Absolutely."]],[4191,["Not of this life but of lives!"]],[4200,["Because that’s a recording system; that records best."]],[4204,["If there are thoughts, it’s like something in between, you see."]],[4207,["Now he is trying to record Me on the film,"]],[4209,["and if there’s something in between, moving, nothing will come in."]],[4212,["But when there is nothing in between"]],[4214,["and you are just seeing through,"]],[4217,["you are recording everything that is important."]],[4220,["Moreover, you’ll be amazed, you don’t record unimportant things."]],[4224,["Like for people now…"]],[4226,["they go to a village or any place;"]],[4231,["they will be recording: “Oh God, it was very dirty,"]],[4235,["and this happened, and we went there,"]],[4237,["and there was cement to sleep,” for example, “we get…”"]],[4242,["Or: “Then we went inside,"]],[4244,["and there was no proper chair to sit down,"]],[4246,["and the chair was so hard,"]],[4248,["and my back started aching” — all these things they will remember."]],[4253,["And then what happened? “Oh God, I couldn’t get Realization…”"]],[4258,["Everything that bad."]],[4259,["You see, it’s just like newspaper, all bad news."]],[4265,["But to a person who is a realized soul in a real way…"]],[4268,["he doesn’t see; I mean, you don’t smell anything dirty,"]],[4271,["you always smell something good."]],[4273,["You never smell, you do not think of anything dirty."]],[4276,["Everywhere you go is beautiful."]],[4278,["Even if you see just a sand, you see the pattern."]],[4281,["Even if you see a barren hill."]],[4283,["I saw some people who had gone;"]],[4285,["I said, “Look at the beauty of these hills in Maharashtra.”"]],[4288,["They said, “Mother, what is the beauty?"]],[4289,["It’s not covered with trees.”"]],[4291,["I said, “That’s the beauty, just see it, the patterns.”"]],[4294,["They couldn’t see the patterns that I was seeing."]],[4296,["But if you ask Me what is this hill, I also know that."]],[4300,["Because I know the patterns of all the hills —"]],[4302,["how it has moved, how it has made patterns and things like that."]],[4309,["Because they don’t see that. You see, they cannot see the beauty,"]],[4313,["because they are looking out for defects."]],[4315,["Or, relatively, you see: “English trees are better"]],[4318,["than, say, XYZ trees.”"]],[4321,["So, then — “This is not better.” The relative… they start."]],[4325,["But you are at absolute point,"]],[4327,["you are getting the absolute of everything. Everything is your own."]],[4331,["What is there to judge?"]],[4333,["YOGI: Mother, perhaps You can see the beauty because You are the Artist."]],[4335,["SHRI MATAJI: Eh?"]],[4336,["YOGI: Perhaps You can see the beauty because You are the Artist."]],[4339,["SHRI MATAJI: I am the Artist and I am the Art."]],[4340,["But what about you? Who are you?"]],[4343,["You are the… you are the one who is created,"]],[4347,["and you can create, and you can become the artist."]],[4350,["That’s what I’m saying — that you are not only the light"]],[4353,["but the light that will give light to others."]],[4355,["And, also, you will sustain that light which you have given light."]],[4359,["This is the difference now between you and other people."]],[4362,["Not that only you will be an artist"]],[4364,["but you’ll enjoy the art of the Artist."]],[4369,["This is what you have got."]],[4370,["You don’t know, you are not aware of your powers."]],[4374,["It’s a dynamic thing which has happened to you,"]],[4377,["which you should take to."]],[4382,["But our attention is on from where the dirt is coming,"]],[4385,["where the filth is coming, you know;"]],[4387,["where the ugliness is there."]],[4390,["If your attention is on ugliness…"]],[4392,["People tell Me, “There was this [UNCLEAR].” I didn’t see,"]],[4394,["I just saw the way the elephant was standing, you see;"]],[4398,["the way he has pulled up his leg and he was raising his trunk."]],[4402,["I never saw the dirt part of it. “Where was it?”"]],[4405,["“At the back of it.” I say, “I never went on the back.”"]],[4410,["If your attention is on… even description of a person."]],[4414,["You ask a person, “How is he?”"]],[4416,["“He’s a…”"]],[4418,["All his… I mean, little funny points will come to your head."]],[4421,["Even the photographers, I’ve seen."]],[4423,["They will only take photograph when you are in a funny way, you see;"]],[4427,["when your face is little turned round…"]],[4429,["I mean, it’s a seeking after ugliness,"]],[4431,["seeking after mistakes, seeking after something wrong."]],[4435,["All the time if you do like this, you cannot be a happy person."]],[4439,["All the time trying to find out defects,"]],[4441,["and faults, and mistakes, and dirt, and ugliness."]],[4447,["I mean, you are in for trouble. You’re asking for it."]],[4453,["Like a person was saying there are three-four ditches in this place."]],[4457,["I said, “Did you jump into one of them? Better jump in."]],[4460,["So, once for all, you don’t see any other ditch.”"]],[4464,["You don’t see the playing grounds,"]],[4466,["you are just seeing the ditches. For what?!"]],[4472,["The same thing can look ugly to a person"]],[4476,["who is of that kind of an attitude,"]],[4478,["who wants to see everything ugly."]],[4482,["Try your attitudes. Try to see good in others."]],[4485,["Try to see… not in… may not be… it…"]],[4490,["I’m not saying for other people,"]],[4491,["but I’m saying at least for Sahaja Yogis you can do it."]],[4494,["Try to see good in them; what good they have done to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[4498,["what you owe to them, how to get along with them."]],[4500,["Why not see the good of them?"]],[4504,["By giving them encouragement, by being good to them"]],[4507,["you are helping Sahaja Yoga."]],[4508,["But you want to help your ego, because you are very “wise”."]],[4515,["So, then only, when by appreciating another person only,"]],[4518,["you have better relationship. This is a very simple fact."]],[4525,["You see any film — there the two people are talking to each other"]],[4528,["as if they are barking at each other."]],[4530,["What does it take to be kind, to be gentle, to say pleasant things?"]],[4536,["As soon as they will see a person — “Oh God!"]],[4538,["You have become very ugly!” This is the best compliment."]],[4549,["That’s human nature —"]],[4551,["to see to the faults of others,"]],[4554,["to see to the wrong things of others."]],[4556,["You see, they will find out in anything."]],[4558,["Somebody is very tidy — then that person is bad."]],[4561,["Somebody is very untidy — that person is bad. Every sort of thing."]],[4564,["But why not you do something about yourself,"]],[4567,["that there’s something inside you which is not tidy?"]],[4571,["And inside you that’s very upsetting."]],[4573,["To Me it makes no difference, you have seen it."]],[4576,["It makes no difference. If you say, I’ll sleep here."]],[4578,["If you say, I’ll sleep on the… on the grass there."]],[4582,["To Me makes no difference to what bathroom I go…"]],[4585,["I don’t even remember all those things."]],[4586,["What is there to remember in a bathroom, and this, and that?"]],[4589,["All nonsense it is. I have no memory for all these things."]],[4593,["Even if you want Me to know, I will not remember."]],[4596,["If you ask Me, “How did you go to that bathroom?” —"]],[4598,["“Which one?” “That one.” I said, “It’s all right, I’ve been there.”"]],[4604,["Then food. “What sort of a taste it was?”"]],[4606,["and “What food it was?” and…"]],[4608,["all sorts of things people go on thinking a lot."]],[4611,["What’s the use? The whole food is going to just be digested"]],[4613,["in the same stomach."]],[4615,["What is there to be so much worried about all these things?"]],[4618,["We are wasting our energy. I don’t waste My energy."]],[4622,["I have no energy for wasting."]],[4625,["In the same way, why do you waste your energy?"]],[4627,["Why not see to the better side of man?"]],[4631,["By seeing bad side, if you can cure it — well and good."]],[4634,["But if you cannot cure it, you are going to get yourself bad."]],[4638,["If you can cure it — nothing like it. But you can’t."]],[4646,["Also once… always person say, “I would not do that.”"]],[4652,["But you would do something else that the other person would not do."]],[4658,["When judging others,"]],[4660,["one has to know one should judge oneself first of all."]],[4664,["Because with what are you judging? With your ego or superego."]],[4672,["I’ve seen, it’s a very common failing,"]],[4675,["which should not be there any more."]],[4677,["Now you are realized souls, you are saints. And the saints…"]],[4681,["though olden saints might be doing whatever they did — forget them."]],[4684,["But you people are not going to see the faults of each other"]],[4688,["but to the good points of everyone."]],[4691,["Simple things I’ve seen:"]],[4692,["somebody says a wrong English word, or a Sanskrit word,"]],[4696,["or a wrong this — immediately you will catch on that."]],[4699,["But he gives a big lecture — it’s all right. That nobody listens."]],[4703,["Your mind is working: “What wrong thing he’s going to say?”"]],[4712,["Attention should be onto what he said, it’s so beautiful."]],[4718,["And then you will develop an attitude — as Mine is —"]],[4721,["you’ll never see to the defects of the place. Never."]],[4730,["Never. [UNCLEAR]. You will have no eyes to see."]],[4735,["I mean, Mine is like that, condition is like that, I tell you."]],[4738,["It will be like that. It’s very difficult."]],[4741,["Like somebody says, “You come and play those cards with sticks” —"]],[4744,["I never remember. I’ll always lose."]],[4746,["So I said, “What’s the use of play it? I don’t remember.”"]],[4749,["See, everybody says, “You have so many brains otherwise,"]],[4751,["can’t you remember these three cards?”"]],[4753,["I can’t, I can’t. It’s just My brain goes off."]],[4755,["I put automa… I don’t know."]],[4757,["I look like a stupid fool when I play that game."]],[4759,["So why should I play?"]],[4762,["Anything like that — I am absolutely good for nothing."]],[4765,["So it’s a thing people know: “Oh, she is useless. Forget her.”"]],[4771,["But it should become automatic with you also."]],[4776,["Then it’s so enjoyable: how beautiful we are,"]],[4780,["that everything is so beautiful around us to see."]],[4783,["Such beauty exists and we do not see it!"]],[4786,["Such tremendous joy! Every bliss is there flowing within us."]],[4790,["And we don’t know, we don’t notice it. It’s such a happy thing."]],[4794,["It’s such a beautiful thing."]],[4796,["“Oh God, such a source of joy!” —"]],[4798,["was just standing next to Me. I never knew."]],[4801,["And just I turned round and saw that force. Turn round!"]],[4807,["Turn your back to all conditionings of yours,"]],[4812,["the ideas that you have…"]],[4815,["Do not pass judgement, first thing is."]],[4818,["Great art critics and all that, please, I beg of you,"]],[4823,["that do not pass remarks at anything all the time."]],[4830,["Is ego playing the trick."]],[4832,["Just watch it, how it is making you feel"]],[4836,["that you are something very great. Be careful."]],[4847,["There were some people coming from America, have they come?"]],[4851,["YOGINI: Steve and Christine, they called to say…"]],[4853,["SHRI MATAJI: They haven’t come."]],[4854,["YOGINI: They’re coming in one week. One more week they’re coming."]],[4858,["SHRI MATAJI: So then we’ll decide, when they come here,"]],[4861,["what is to be done."]],[4862,["Linda, for your problem, what is the thing to be done?"]],[4865,["Will you get out of your personal problems or not?"]],[4867,["YOGINI: Yes, Mother.","SHRI MATAJI: No, I’m talking to Linda now."]],[4876,["YOGINI: I’m… Which Linda?"]],[4880,["[UNCLEAR]."]],[4887,["SHRI MATAJI: I would suggest you should stay with your mother."]],[4889,["She needs you. She’s an old woman, she needs you."]],[4893,["You must serve her. There’s nothing wrong in it."]],[4896,["YOGINI: Very possessive."]],[4898,["SHRI MATAJI: No no no. You are inadequate,"]],[4900,["not that she is inadequate."]],[4903,["You have to serve her. Give her love, affection."]],[4907,["She is lonely. She behaves like that because she is lonely."]],[4910,["You are inadequate; I won’t say to her anything."]],[4914,["She needs… she never had love, and you are the only child she has."]],[4919,["You should love her. Give her more love, more affection."]],[4923,["And, also, what she says about Peter, you should do that."]],[4927,["Will give her consolation. She’s going crazy because of that."]],[4931,["YOGINI: Trouble is, Mother, she said,"]],[4933,["“It’s like ten years doing Sahaja Yoga.”"]],[4934,["SHRI MATAJI: Let her say. Her saying nothing matters."]],[4938,["You see, that’s not the thing, that’s just an escape."]],[4941,["Because you are crazy, that’s why she thinks like that."]],[4943,["YOGINI: I know that. I don’t blame, of course."]],[4945,["SHRI MATAJI: But you should establish yourself"]],[4947,["with more patience, with more love and affection."]],[4949,["She’d say, “Do hundred times Sahaja Yoga.”"]],[4952,["How much she’s changed her attitude —"]],[4953,["because when you went there you went crazy."]],[4955,["And you are quite crazy sometimes, I’ve seen."]],[4958,["First of all, you must be a tidy person,"]],[4960,["neat person; must look after her."]],[4962,["You must take up her responsibility of looking after."]],[4965,["She’s an old woman, who has had no love all her life."]],[4970,["What she wants is love,"]],[4971,["and as a child, daughter, you must give her love."]],[4974,["Whatever she is. You can’t leave her alone."]],[4978,["If you give her love, I’m sure you can cure her."]],[4981,["You take up… it, take it up as a challenge."]],[4984,["And give her a bandhan; everybody can give her a bandhan."]],[4987,["And put her right. You cannot be helpless like that."]],[4990,["To run away from your duties towards your mother,"]],[4992,["I will never allow you."]],[4996,["You can go to Cheltenham, start a centre there,"]],[4999,["attend it, do it. You have to."]],[5002,["YOGINI: Do you want me actually live with her?"]],[5007,["YOGI: Should she live with her mother?"]],[5008,["SHRI MATAJI: Yes, of course. Why not?"]],[5011,["She is your own mother. She’s not such a cruel woman."]],[5016,["I don’t think so. I have seen her."]],[5022,["But you get crazy yourself, I know. I know that."]],[5025,["This is how you will test yourself."]],[5027,["You should live with her. After all, she’s so old now."]],[5030,["What’s her age?"]],[5031,["YOGINI: Sixty-four… sixty-three."]],[5033,["SHRI MATAJI: See now. At sixty-three,"]],[5035,["if she’s left alone in that house, what will she do?"]],[5043,["You tell her that “I’ve decided"]],[5045,["to do what you have told me about Peter…”"]],[5049,["YOGINI: She hasn’t really tell me anything about Peter;"]],[5053,["I’ve been doing most of the telling."]],[5055,["SHRI MATAJI: All right, whatever it is. She’ll be all right."]],[5058,["You see, you try to tell her these things —"]],[5060,["she’ll be all right. You tell her."]],[5061,["Just like this: “And now I’m going to look after you."]],[5064,["You are very sick. You are not well.”"]],[5067,["Take care. Did you talk to her kindly sometimes?"]],[5072,["YOGINI: Well, I tried."]],[5073,["SHRI MATAJI: No, you did not."]],[5076,["You did not, that’s what it is."]],[5079,["As a Sahaja Yogi, you have to be extremely kind"]],[5081,["and compassionate towards her."]],[5082,["She’s an old woman, had no love from her husband…"]],[5086,["She has tried to do something for you always."]],[5090,["So, as a daughter, you have a duty."]],[5094,["YOGINI: I’m very worried about Bumble"]],[5096,["because it’s a sort of 3-cornered arrangement which comes out."]],[5098,["SHRI MATAJI: What happens about Bumble?"]],[5099,["YOGINI: Well, Bumble sort of finishes up"]],[5102,["in between me and her. It’s…"]],[5104,["SHRI MATAJI: But if you finish off from yourself,"]],[5106,["she won’t be finishing off like that."]],[5109,["See, why do you create a problem between you and her, first of all?"]],[5112,["There should be no gap."]],[5114,["If there is no gap, then there won’t be any problem."]],[5117,["The problem is because you are a problem and she is a problem,"]],[5120,["so the child suffers."]],[5122,["But if you just have nothing, you… if she tells…"]],[5125,["on the contrary, if a child tells anything about your mother,"]],[5128,["you should say, “Don’t say like that to my… she is my mother.”"]],[5131,["Tomorrow she will turn back and tell you that, take it from Me."]],[5137,["She is much more sensible in this than you are."]],[5141,["You should not tell her anything about your mother."]],[5144,["You should say, “She has been very kind to me and nice to me.”"]],[5147,["If it is communicated to her — if through Bumble —"]],[5150,["things will be all right."]],[5152,["See, how long is she going to live"]],[5153,["with this kind of life she has had. All right?"]],[5159,["Where are you going to try your Sahaja Yoga"]],[5162,["if you can’t try on your own mother?"]],[5164,["YOGINI: She wouldn’t have it."]],[5165,["SHRI MATAJI: No, that’s not the way. It’s not outside, it is inside."]],[5170,["YOGINI: I try to cook for her and she won’t eat what I cook."]],[5173,["SHRI MATAJI: You don’t have to do it outside,"]],[5176,["you have to do it inside with her."]],[5179,["Be kind, be gentle, be of service."]],[5182,["At the most, she’ll shout sometimes, doesn’t matter."]],[5184,["Forgive her. Forgive her."]],[5186,["YOGINI: She has vomiting, which really worries me."]],[5188,["She doesn’t sleep at night."]],[5190,["She wanders around talking to herself for whole time."]],[5193,["SHRI MATAJI: You see, it’s all right,"]],[5195,["if she doesn’t sleep, then you can say some mantras in your heart."]],[5198,["You know there’s a mantra of Nidra and all that."]],[5201,["You put her left to the right — she’ll sleep off."]],[5203,["You do it, all that. She’ll sleep. You should say that “Breathe in,"]],[5207,["three times, heavily. You’ll sleep off.”"]],[5210,["And if you… when she’s talking also, if you sleep off,"]],[5212,["she is not going to wake you up again."]],[5215,["You just doze off there, and she’ll say,"]],[5217,["“All right, you go and sleep now,” formally."]],[5221,["It’s very simple to fight out this thing."]],[5225,["I mean, she needs you very much. She can’t sleep, just imagine."]],[5228,["Your mother can’t sleep, how can you run away from her?"]],[5233,["Just see her condition. She is your mother."]],[5235,["YOGINI: She is in a terrible state."]],[5236,["SHRI MATAJI: Then how can you leave her? You can’t."]],[5239,["Can’t leave her. No, I wouldn’t say that."]],[5242,["You can’t leave your mother."]],[5245,["You know, Kathy wanted to come with Me. You remember Kathy?"]],[5248,["YOGINI: Yes, Mother.","SHRI MATAJI: When I told her,"]],[5249,["“You can’t leave your mother in the hospital,"]],[5251,["come with Me to India. No, you can’t.”"]],[5254,["She missed that [THING?] completely."]],[5255,["I told her, “You stay with your mother.” She is here. Just ask her."]],[5260,["I did tell her."]],[5261,["And she was cancer, this thing, with the Sahaja Yoga and all that,"]],[5265,["and she used to attend to her. She stayed back."]],[5267,["No, you can’t leave your parents like that, you see."]],[5270,["Parents are very important things after certain age."]],[5273,["You have to look after them."]],[5276,["Whatever they are. You must look after your parents,"]],[5278,["that’s very important in Sahaja Yoga."]],[5284,["Your Right Heart cannot be all right, Shri Rama cannot be all right"]],[5287,["if you don’t look after your mother."]],[5293,["She is not such a bad woman. I’ve seen her."]],[5297,["And if she was a very cruel, horrible, this sort of thing,"]],[5300,["then I would have said, “All right, forget her.”"]],[5302,["But she is not that way. She is not either so much…"]],[5306,["She is drinking because she has no company;"]],[5309,["she doesn’t know what to do with herself."]],[5310,["So she is trying to run away from herself."]],[5312,["Is very simple to understand. You be kind and gentle."]],[5317,["Give her some value, that she is something to you."]],[5320,["She’ll be all right."]],[5323,["I’ve seen, she is not a bad woman."]],[5326,["Lot of her sense comes into you also, her goodness."]],[5329,["YOGINI: I’m bothered, I think, by… when Grazyna came to stay,"]],[5335,["she felt… Grazyna felt that…"]],[5337,["she had this brother, you see, who [UNCLEAR]…"]],[5339,["he killed himself [MOTOR-RACING?]."]],[5341,["She saw him die in front of her."]],[5343,["SHRI MATAJI: What’s it?"]],[5344,["YOGINI: And she had this brother, my mother,"]],[5346,["who she loved very much. And he…"]],[5348,["SHRI MATAJI: That I’ve heard of already; that story I know."]],[5350,["Whatever she has done, whatever it is."]],[5352,["YOGINI: She seems very [UNCLEAR]."]],[5353,["SHRI MATAJI: Doesn’t matter. But by leaving her,"]],[5355,["are you going to help her by that?"]],[5356,["You should fill the position of that brother."]],[5359,["You should say, “Doesn’t matter. If the brother has died,"]],[5361,["I am here to look after you, mother.”"]],[5363,["Why is she hankering after the brother?"]],[5365,["She thinks that if the brother had lived,"]],[5367,["he would look after her in old age."]],[5368,["But God knows if he had look after; he would run away too."]],[5374,["Why can’t you fill the place of the brother? You can. Why not?"]],[5378,["You take it up upon yourself. You can do it, I know."]],[5381,["All right? You look upon her as you look upon Me."]],[5387,["Why not? Just try. It is worth it. It’s worth it."]],[5398,["Be nice and gentle. Say nice things, pleasant things to her."]],[5403,["Show interest in her life."]],[5407,["Actually, you see, all this has come from the psychologists also."]],[5410,["Horrible ones."]],[5413,["No, they always suggest their mother did something."]],[5415,["Everybody I saw, they said, “My mother is like…”"]],[5417,["I said, “How can everybody’s mother be so cruel?"]],[5420,["Could be some people’s but not everybody’s.”"]],[5423,["And, also, if they have deviated from right path,"]],[5425,["it is because they never got their love."]],[5427,["They never got their place in life."]],[5430,["See, the husbands must have ill-treated them, tortured their lives,"]],[5434,["and must have been after them; or maybe they had some other problems"]],[5438,["from their parents, or something. Everybody’s mother has tortured…"]],[5443,["It’s a psychology, I think. That way, mother is, in a way…"]],[5448,["always if you look at her from a wrong angle,"]],[5451,["she will look like your enemy."]],[5465,["In the West, the mother picture is horrible."]],[5473,["Also wars, things have come in that generation;"]],[5476,["people have been shattered of their values."]],[5478,["All you must understand what kind of life"]],[5480,["this horrible Western society can give to women who are good."]],[5485,["Good women are really tortured in this society."]],[5488,["Only the smart ones and the ones who are very arrogant"]],[5491,["and who know how to put men right"]],[5493,["and women right in their places can exist."]],[5495,["You see, this is what it is. It’s a regular struggle here."]],[5500,["Any good woman is tortured in this society."]],[5502,["I mean, if she exists and she really lives,"]],[5505,["it’s something surprising. Ask, Maria will tell you. You ask her."]],[5513,["How they put them down, how they insult them, how…"]],[5516,["I mean, everybody has seen this happening here."]],[5521,["But don’t blame the mother all the time."]],[5526,["At this stage you must look after. So, now what is next?"]],[5531,["YOGI: Sorry, could you marry me and my girlfriend"]],[5534,["some time in future, do You think?"]],[5536,["SHRI MATAJI: What’s it?"]],[5539,["YOGI: Marry him and his girlfriend."]],[5542,["SHRI MATAJI: Who is your girlfriend?"]],[5544,["YOGI: She is not here tonight, she is in…"]],[5546,["SHRI MATAJI: She is not a Sahaja Yogini?"]],[5548,["YOGI: She’s come from Bedford. Yes, she is a Sahaja Yogini."]],[5551,["SHRI MATAJI: She’s Sahaja Yogini."]],[5553,["So you want to have a marriage on Krishnashtami?"]],[5556,["Some of the marriage to be performed?"]],[5558,["YOGI: [YES, PLEASE]."]],[5560,["SHRI MATAJI: Now, when is the Krishnashtami?"]],[5562,["YOGI: Next Sunday, Mother."]],[5577,["YOGI: Some time in the future, not…"]],[5585,["SHRI MATAJI: You see, the best place to get married is in India."]],[5588,["Very easy, and you have a real feeling"]],[5591,["because you come on a horse, and this and that, you see."]],[5594,["But even if you want to have in Krishnashtami day,"]],[5598,["I don’t know if we can get really somebody to do it."]],[5601,["If somebody we can get, we should do it."]],[5604,["There are people who want to get married."]],[5606,["But, you see, Sahaja Yoga marriage is taken for granted."]],[5610,["I’ve seen, people do not have that understanding."]],[5613,["And it’s very dangerous to play with it, very dangerous. See?"]],[5617,["So, I think, if you have some time given to yourself,"]],[5620,["I will definitely marry."]],[5622,["Best thing is, I think, let people take some time"]],[5625,["and decide, because…"]],[5626,["you see, it’s very funny, nobody feels responsible about it."]],[5630,["They’ll come out with an explanation:"]],[5632,["“Oh, I didn’t understand, and I was not in a position to do it;"]],[5636,["I was still possessed with a bhoot. And I married another bhoot.”"]],[5652,["YOGI: [UNCLEAR], I’ve lived with her for two years."]],[5656,["SHRI MATAJI: With her?"]],[5657,["YOGI: Yes, with her."]],[5659,["SHRI MATAJI: That is, you have given sufficient time now?"]],[5661,["But, you see, one thing is:"]],[5663,["their living in the West is simple… people."]],[5666,["But if you tell them, “Marriage” — Oh God! They go… go amok."]],[5670,["They go amok. You see, if it’s a marriage — aah!"]],[5674,["Ask David Prole, he’ll tell you."]],[5682,["You see, because the law is so horrifyingly funny here,"]],[5686,["marriage — Oh God, it means horrible things."]],[5689,["You have to separate, you have to…"]],[5691,["if you have to divorce… the first thing about divorce:"]],[5693,["“You’ll have to give so much money”,"]],[5694,["“Half money the wife will take away”, “She’ll murder me…”"]],[5697,["You see, they show “husband murders wife,"]],[5699,["wife murders husband” — all sorts of things, you know."]],[5702,["All the time it is like going on in this country —"]],[5704,["is madness about marriage."]],[5706,["So, I think is a good idea."]],[5711,["I would like — if you can arrange —"]],[5712,["because Krishnashtami is a good time to marry people."]],[5715,["Our sixteen marriages, which one has failed?"]],[5719,["Last time?"]],[5721,["For the sixteen… no, sixteen here, in London."]],[5726,["Who were the sixteen people, let’s see."]],[5731,["All first class. All first class, yeah."]],[5738,["Yeah. Good."]],[5744,["So, for next marriage lot…"]],[5750,["Some will be lucky in behind like Nick; I would like him to marry."]],[5755,["Now you are not so frightened, are you? Nick? No. It’s good."]],[5769,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[5772,["On the Dashera day we can have marriage."]],[5775,["Dussehra day. That’s another day one can marry."]],[5778,["Now, Krishnashtami and Dussehra day… of course, after the Diwali,"]],[5781,["after the marriage of the Tulasi —"]],[5784,["then only people start, but Dussehra day is very very good,"]],[5788,["it’s very auspicious. [PHRASE IN HINDI]."]],[5790,["So we’ll have marriages on Dashera day."]],[5793,["Till then, prepare people for marriage."]],[5798,["All right? Dashera will be, say, about…"]],[5812,["End of October. About. All right?"]],[5815,["YOGI: Yes, lovely, thank you."]],[5817,["SHRI MATAJI: Let’s find out where will I be."]],[5820,["So, that’s how."]],[5824,["YOGI: Mother, I was going to ask that…"]],[5827,["some Sahaja Yogis who’ve been in Sahaja Yoga for a long time"]],[5830,["don’t feel cool breeze; they don’t feel any catches."]],[5834,["Some people feel burning all the time;"]],[5836,["some people feel these things in their head,"]],[5838,["in their body, toes, hands."]],[5840,["It’s the way we’re gonna develop,"]],[5843,["where you can feel things — all of us, all over —"]],[5848,["or is it just some people feel different things?"]],[5852,["SHRI MATAJI: No no. You see, to begin with,"]],[5855,["you see, it has something to do with your nervous system. All right?"]],[5858,["So, if your nervous system is disturbed, you may not feel, at all."]],[5862,["For the nervous system, best thing is to do massage."]],[5865,["You see, somebody should massage their back, hands…"]],[5867,["Also, I’ve told many a times that you rub your hands"]],[5870,["with vibrated olive oil, quite a lot,"]],[5873,["and rub these things, so they become sensitive."]],[5875,["Could be with insensitivity."]],[5877,["But if they can feel the catches in the body,"]],[5880,["that means they are all right, only the Vishuddhi is not all right."]],[5883,["Rub the thing on the Vishuddhi, work on Vishuddhi, clear it out."]],[5887,["And for Vishuddhi, if you can use, say,"]],[5890,["butter to rub on the… here,"]],[5893,["and rub all these muscles, you see, with that."]],[5896,["All these things will work out, for your hand."]],[5898,["But supposing you are… there’s no cool breeze"]],[5901,["coming out of the head, possibly."]],[5903,["Then the Realization yet not has established."]],[5905,["See, other people should say whether there is a cool breeze coming,"]],[5908,["because the person who is not realized may not feel it."]],[5910,["Supposing he does not feel it, and you feel it,"]],[5913,["then he is realized; only thing, his chakras are to be cleared out."]],[5915,["It’s a different different category of people."]],[5918,["Then, there are some people whose Kundalini has not risen;"]],[5921,["they are still Sahaja Yogis. Like that."]],[5923,["Maybe. I don’t know if there are any."]],[5925,["Those people who are unmarried for long,"]],[5928,["they are very difficult people because they never feel"]],[5931,["the cool breeze in the hand, quite a lot. Like that."]],[5933,["But it is not so. They are realized souls in any case."]],[5936,["They may not feel it, but they are realized souls, you see."]],[5938,["Because a kind of a softness, a kind of a balance"]],[5941,["is developed after marriage — which is not there."]],[5944,["And that’s how some people don’t feel it."]],[5947,["There are various reasons."]],[5949,["Some people who are ego-oriented more —"]],[5951,["they should turn their left to the right many a times."]],[5954,["They should find out… from the hands, you see."]],[5956,["One hand is bigger, one hand is smaller."]],[5958,["That means the left hand — if it is smaller —"]],[5960,["that means you have to raise left to the right."]],[5963,["You see, from the size of the hands and all that you can see it."]],[5965,["Putting one hand towards the photograph, another hand outside…"]],[5968,["Work it out in so many ways,"]],[5970,["because you have permutations and combinations of certain mistakes."]],[5974,["But that doesn’t mean you develop this Left Vishuddhi by any chance."]],[5977,["Because that’s the worst thing that can happen."]],[5979,["If you develop the Left Vishuddhi,"]],[5980,["then it’s a very difficult situation for you."]],[5986,["Now, for this kind of a thing,"]],[5991,["I think I’ll give you a complete lecture on one day."]],[5995,["Complete. As to see what permutations and combinations"]],[5998,["of different chakras can create. All right?"]],[6006,["But symptoms are outside."]],[6008,["The symptoms are mostly outside; there’s no need to…"]],[6011,["from a personality you can see what it is he is catching, you see."]],[6018,["Is a very… problem, great problem with people,"]],[6021,["that they don’t feel the vibrations; some people just don’t feel it."]],[6025,["How many there are like that, who never feel any vibrations?"]],[6029,["Never felt, never… raise you hand. I know, Kerry."]],[6033,["YOGI: Not never."]],[6034,["SHRI MATAJI: And you never… you have felt it sometime. All right."]],[6038,["YOGI: Mother, since I came to the ashram I’ve been…"]],[6041,["my hands have been very hot all the time."]],[6043,["SHRI MATAJI: Which way? YOGI: But I feel the catches inside."]],[6046,["SHRI MATAJI: Both the hands are?"]],[6048,["What work you are doing in the ashram?"]],[6052,["YOGI: Not very much, Mother."]],[6054,["SHRI MATAJI: All right. You had a left-side catch, all right?"]],[6057,["You can see it clearly: your right hand is very shining,"]],[6059,["the left — there is a problem."]],[6061,["You see, these fingers are not so shining as the things are."]],[6065,["You had a left-side problem, if you remember it. All right?"]],[6068,["So, that’s fighting. In the ashram, the vibrations are fighting,"]],[6071,["that’s why you feel hot. There’s nothing wrong with it."]],[6073,["It will correct, it will have cool breeze."]],[6075,["Put your right hand always up, and left hand towards Me."]],[6078,["It will correct you."]],[6083,["When did you come?"]],[6095,["Oh, I see. You’re staying here? In the ashram?"]],[6100,["YOGI: No, he’s not in the ashram, Mother."]],[6102,["SHRI MATAJI: No?"]],[6104,["Where is he staying?"]],[6108,["YOGI: In hotel."]],[6110,["SHRI MATAJI: Why, you stay in here."]],[6112,["And get your Sahaja Yoga all right."]],[6116,["He is from…"]],[6124,["Now better. All right?"]],[6127,["YOGI: He’s coming tomorrow, Mother, to stay."]],[6130,["SHRI MATAJI: All right, good idea."]],[6131,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[6135,["So, now, can I go now?"]],[6139,["YOGI: We should offer You a sari."]],[6145,["SHRI MATAJI: This is Gavin’s idea of a sari, isn’t it?"]],[6150,["What color is this?"]],[6156,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[6161,["What’s it?"]],[6166,["What a beautiful one! Where did you take this one?"]],[6171,["It’s like a painting."]],[6175,["Where?"]],[6176,["YOGI: Sahasrara Puja in Paris."]],[6178,["SHRI MATAJI: In Paris?"]],[6186,["It’s beautiful! It’s for Me or for the ashram?"]],[6195,["YOGI: He has brought it to You, Mother."]],[6198,["SHRI MATAJI: Thank you."]],[6201,["It’s too beautiful. Very beautiful it is."]],[6224,["Thank you. May God bless you."]],[6231,["You’ll stay here for sometime?"]],[6238,["YOGI: A week, Mother."]],[6240,["SHRI MATAJI: Week, all right, good."]],[6242,["Christine, then I’ll come and see you all, Americans, eh?"]],[6246,["Here, Monday."]],[6248,["And we’ll discuss about what is to be done in the future program."]],[6252,["Now. Anything?"]],[6254,["YOGI: Mother, I have brought You a present."]],[6256,["SHRI MATAJI: Present?"]],[6257,["YOGI: For small [THING?]. Some photographs."]],[6261,["SHRI MATAJI: Thank you. I would like to see."]],[6262,["It’s beautiful, isn’t it? This is Italian style. See? Is Italian."]],[6267,["They make everything so beautiful."]],[6270,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[6271,["It’s very loving and nice. You had taken this photograph?"]],[6278,["And enlarged it?"]],[6284,["Beautiful it is."]],[6289,["Very gentle and nice."]],[6300,["This is from that garden… which I didn’t see?"]],[6303,["It’s beautiful lotuses Rustem has in Derbyshire."]],[6308,["In Derbyshire, I couldn’t see that [ONE?], really."]],[6311,["I was surprised, they say that you can’t grow a lotus here."]],[6315,["I don’t know how they do it, really."]],[6317,["YOGINI: They call them something else, that sort of…"]],[6321,["SHRI MATAJI: Must be. See this one."]],[6328,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[6332,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[6336,["So beautiful they are."]],[6339,["Rustem, you have become a great photographer."]],[6347,["YOGI: He’s got four years experience."]],[6354,["YOGI: They grow in Hampstead, Mother, too."]],[6356,["SHRI MATAJI: Hampstead?"]],[6357,["YOGI: Yes, they are in the ponds in Hampstead [UNCLEAR]."]],[6359,["SHRI MATAJI: I don’t know how they manage it,"]],[6360,["you see, this cold. It’s tremendous."]],[6362,["But they grow in the cold because [UNCLEAR] also"]],[6365,["they have these. So, must be."]],[6367,["YOGI: They can grow in the cold, no problem."]],[6370,["SHRI MATAJI: Now…"]],[6372,["[SHRI MATAJI SPEAKS WITH A SAHAJA YOGI IN HINDI]"]],[6389,["Now, Harry, your problem is solved?"]],[6391,["YOGI: Not as yet, Mother. SHRI MATAJI: Why? What happened?"]],[6393,["YOGI: I called my employers, and they said that"]],[6396,["they’ve not quite sorted whether they should re-employ me."]],[6401,["So they gave me one week. He said he will call me back next week."]],[6405,["SHRI MATAJI: Or you just go and tell them"]],[6407,["that “You give me just an employment,”"]],[6409,["saying that “for only three months at the most.”"]],[6412,["YOGI: Yes."]],[6413,["SHRI MATAJI: But just say that “We give you employment,"]],[6415,["we re-employ you,” that’s all."]],[6417,["YOGI: Yes, I’ll go to there."]],[6430,["SHRI MATAJI: What else?"]],[6432,["YOGI: These ladies are too shy, Mother, to tell them to come in."]],[6435,["SHRI MATAJI: Who?"]],[6436,["YOGI: Some ladies to give You the sari, Mother."]],[6439,["SHRI MATAJI: To give Me a sari? All right."]],[6440,["This is the one that puja sari Gavin has brought."]],[6445,["Who will give Me?"]],[6447,["Give it now. Come along, you girls."]],[6451,["Also he has brought one sari for Me,"]],[6453,["which I… use it on Janmashtami also, from…"]],[6456,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[6458,["from Bombay."]],[6459,["May God bless you."]],[6463,["How is he? Did he get a job?"]],[6465,["YOGINI: [UNCLEAR]."]],[6469,["SHRI MATAJI: What did he say?"]],[6473,["He’s not [UNCLEAR]?"]],[6474,["YOGI: He got a job, he is the head of all the translators in Spain."]],[6480,["YOGINI: He called me last Tuesday,"]],[6481,["he said, head of… in the embassy…"]],[6484,["of the translate people."]],[6487,["YOGI: The chief translator,"]],[6488,["is the head of the translation stuff in the embassy."]],[6491,["SHRI MATAJI: Really?"]],[6498,["YOGINI: He says he has a big responsibility now, Mother."]],[6501,["SHRI MATAJI: Good. How much is he paid? How much is he paid?"]],[6504,["YOGINI: 240 pounds.","SHRI MATAJI: How much?"]],[6506,["YOGINI: 240 pounds per month."]],[6509,["SHRI MATAJI: Two thousand?","YOGINI: Two hundred."]],[6512,["SHRI MATAJI: And forty pounds. Per month."]],[6515,["YOGI: It’s very reasonable course, Spanish [UNCLEAR]."]],[6517,["SHRI MATAJI: For Spain, it is. It is very reasonable."]],[6520,["YOGINI: Also, he’s work only six hours a day."]],[6523,["SHRI MATAJI: And where does he live?"]],[6525,["YOGINI: He stay with Jose Antonio."]],[6529,["SHRI MATAJI: He’s happy there?"]],[6531,["It’s good that he’s got such a good job."]],[6536,["All right. What is this you have done?"]],[6538,["YOGINI: Michelle made it, Mother."]],[6540,["It’s a [CROWN HERE?], Mother."]],[6542,["SHRI MATAJI: This you give Me on Krishnashtami, will be better."]],[6545,["Isn’t it, with this thing?"]],[6547,["YOGINI: Michelle made it, Mother."]],[6549,["SHRI MATAJI: Michelle? Should give Me on Krishnashtami, all right?"]],[6552,["It’s beautiful."]],[6555,["All right. So just open the sari and put it on [UNCLEAR]."]],[6558,["YOGI: Mother, may I read Your hundred and eight names?"]],[6561,["May I read Your hundred and eight names?"]],[6563,["[IN WRITTEN?] shlokas."]],[6565,["SHRI MATAJI: Who? You?","YOGI: Your names, yes."]],[6568,["SHRI MATAJI: Please, let read it out. Loudly."]],[6743,["You have to raise it higher."]],[6747,["Let Me garland [UNCLEAR]."]],[6754,["It’s beautiful color."]],[6782,["Thank you."]],[6856,["It’s very sweet of the doctor Singh"]],[6859,["to give such a nice job to him Don, isn’t it?"]],[6861,["He’s a great man, doctor Singh."]],[6864,["[SHRI MATAJI SPEAKS WITH A SAHAJA YOGI IN HINDI]"]],[6876,["But we wanted some really Sahaja Yogi to go there."]],[6879,["He knows Spanish also."]],[6881,["But the doctor Singh is taking so much interest, I must say."]],[6885,["YOGINI: Mother, but it’s only for three months."]],[6889,["SHRI MATAJI: All right."]],[6895,["Yes, that’s what he said, that three months [IT IS?]."]],[6897,["That’s it. It may go further."]],[6901,["YOGI: He will have excellent reference after that work."]],[6906,["SHRI MATAJI: Now he can go to other places."]],[6913,["He’s not so attached to anything; I found it from him."]],[6917,["You see, Don is a very deep Sahaja Yogi, very deep."]],[6921,["And he said, “I’m not so particular about Spain."]],[6924,["Any place You send me, Mother, I’ll be going.”"]],[6926,["So he’s not so much attached to… he’s a very deep person."]],[6929,["That was a good answer."]],[6931,["So he can go somewhere else"]],[6934,["if he says,”It’s not that I get attached to Spain.”"]],[6938,["Let’s see. But you better grow now."]],[6940,["Did he tell you what is the problem is?"]],[6944,["And must learn proper English, you see?"]],[6947,["That’s very important because Sahaja Yoga…"]],[6949,["I cannot speak all the languages. So better try to learn."]],[6951,["In here, people should teach English"]],[6953,["to people who don’t know good English, all right?"]],[6956,["Not that English language is God’s language,"]],[6958,["but at least I understand it."]],[6964,["Otherwise, all the English will have [A BIG EGO?]."]],[6969,["And I can’t learn so many languages, all right?"]],[6971,["Try to learn English language"]],[6974,["and, also, understand Sahaja Yoga mentally."]],[6976,["That’s important."]],[6978,["Because you have to explain to people, talk to them."]],[6980,["Because you talk, but it makes no sense on the other people"]],[6983,["if you have not mentally equipped."]],[6986,["Those who are just attached to Sahaja Yoga with heart"]],[6989,["must equip themselves also with mind,"]],[6992,["must understand Sahaja Yoga with mind, is very important."]],[6995,["And those who only understand with mind"]],[6997,["should understand it with heart. All right?"]],[7002,["YOGINI: To reading “The Advent”, Mother,"]],[7004,["is very useful, very helpful to overcome this problem,"]],[7008,["because I had the same problems."]],[7009,["SHRI MATAJI: All right. Try to read “Advent”, explain to her,"]],[7011,["let her understand. How are you? You never came to the…"]],[7017,["YOGI: Unfortunately, I had to work.","SHRI MATAJI: I see."]],[7020,["YOGI: But I [FORGET TO LET YOU KNOW?]."]],[7022,["SHRI MATAJI: All right."]],[7025,["[SHRI MATAJI SPEAKS WITH A SAHAJA YOGI IN HINDI]"]],[7031,["[UNCLEAR] mangalsutra?"]],[7034,["You got two? One will sufficient,"]],[7035,["one you keep it for the next puja."]],[7053,["[SHRI MATAJI SPEAKS WITH A SAHAJA YOGI IN HINDI]"]],[7070,["You must get one made in gold."]],[7073,["When I go to India, I’ll get you one."]],[7076,["It should be used for puja."]],[7078,["[PHRASE IN HINDI]"]],[7085,["And the same can be used every time."]],[7089,["May God bless you."]],[7090,["YOGI: Mother, please forgive us"]],[7092,["for any mistakes we’ve made during Your puja."]],[7094,["SHRI MATAJI: May God bless you."]],[7096,["Make a list now, and get it verified sometimes."]],[7099,["And make a complete list, you see;"]],[7102,["so whenever you go there, try to remember."]],[7105,["You keep one ready. Otherwise, don’t ask for it."]],[7109,["Because it goes little funny there, isn’t it?"]],[7112,["Doesn’t look all right. Because you are such matured Sahaja Yogis."]],[7115,["It is all right for children to make mistakes,"]],[7117,["but you are all matured people, so — doesn’t look nice."]],[7123,["May God bless you."]],[7124,["YOGINI: Mother, for Hampstead"]],[7125,["we do not know so much the protocol of pujas"]],[7128,["and how to… to behave in…"]],[7131,["there is no [ASPECTS TOWARDS YOU?]."]],[7134,["Then, how do You suggest we should educate ourselves?"]],[7138,["SHRI MATAJI: Next time when I’ll give you"]],[7140,["a lecture on this, all right?"]],[7141,["Because requires a real one big lecture, Maria."]],[7145,["May God bless you."]],[7151,["YOGI: Mother, someone is bringing You some food."]],[7156,["Food is being brought, Mother."]],[7157,["SHRI MATAJI: No. You see, My family people"]],[7159,["are going to have food with Me. I’m sorry."]],[7161,["They are all at home. I’m sorry, I have to go."]]]);
